(6471275, 961914, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few that REALLY look like his work.  Most people are just going for blur for blur''s sake and this has the movement that his often does. Love the unexpected crop.  This is a keeper.</td>', 'This is one of the few that REALLY look like his work.  Most people are just going for blur for blur''s sake and this has the movement that his often does. Love the unexpected crop.  This is a keeper.', '2011-07-15 10:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471276, 961742, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love this.  I like that you are using motion for the blur, as he often does.  Many of the entries are just blurred for the sake of blurring. :)</td>', 'Oh I love this.  I like that you are using motion for the blur, as he often does.  Many of the entries are just blurred for the sake of blurring. :)', '2011-07-15 10:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
