(6471533, 961411, 68020, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. My favorite of the bunch - 9</td>', 'Beautiful photo. My favorite of the bunch - 9', '2011-07-15 14:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471534, 961763, 120129, '<td valign="top">I don''t get this. Who''s Oscar? And I can''t see how it''s in the style of bspurgeon, but I think the photo is great and I like that it''s different.</td>', 'I don''t get this. Who''s Oscar? And I can''t see how it''s in the style of bspurgeon, but I think the photo is great and I like that it''s different.', '2011-07-15 14:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471560, 962089, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really dreamy.  His use of motion blur is really depicted here.  I gave it a 7.  My only nit is that his lines created by the blur are usually more smooth, if that makes any sense.  Good luck. :)</td>', 'Really dreamy.  His use of motion blur is really depicted here.  I gave it a 7.  My only nit is that his lines created by the blur are usually more smooth, if that makes any sense.  Good luck. :)', '2011-07-15 15:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471561, 961587, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It has an abstract feel and looks like something Ben would do if he were to approach this idea. 7</td>', 'I like this.  It has an abstract feel and looks like something Ben would do if he were to approach this idea. 7', '2011-07-15 15:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471562, 961162, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of urgency.  Most of his blur is a touch more smooth, but that''s just a nit pick. 7</td>', 'I like the sense of urgency.  Most of his blur is a touch more smooth, but that''s just a nit pick. 7', '2011-07-15 15:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471563, 962321, 15711, '<td valign="top">You got his smooth blur perfectly.  His use of minimalism is captured really well here.  I love the simple things.  That bending plant growing out of the water is a signature of his.  Nice going and good luck.</td>', 'You got his smooth blur perfectly.  His use of minimalism is captured really well here.  I love the simple things.  That bending plant growing out of the water is a signature of his.  Nice going and good luck.', '2011-07-15 15:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471565, 962005, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a tribute to Ben.  I love her net petticoat hanging underneath her dress.  That hint of leg and the grasses - aaaah, summer. 7</td>', 'This is certainly a tribute to Ben.  I love her net petticoat hanging underneath her dress.  That hint of leg and the grasses - aaaah, summer. 7', '2011-07-15 15:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471567, 962325, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yep, this has a Ben touch for sure. I love that she''s running out of the frame.  Nice going. 7</td>', 'Yep, this has a Ben touch for sure. I love that she''s running out of the frame.  Nice going. 7', '2011-07-15 15:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471568, 962104, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is oddly wonderful.</td>', 'This is oddly wonderful.', '2011-07-15 15:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471569, 961933, 57447, '<td valign="top">Thanks for sharing.  I like this.</td>', 'Thanks for sharing.  I like this.', '2011-07-15 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471570, 961917, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like her ragamuffin hair.  The single eye and catch light is great.  For his portraits, he usually captures the face just like you did without his usual blur. 7</td>', 'I like her ragamuffin hair.  The single eye and catch light is great.  For his portraits, he usually captures the face just like you did without his usual blur. 7', '2011-07-15 15:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471571, 962214, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a simple calm to it.  I like the soft blur of the clouds.  The danger sign adds a story to the shot.  Nice one. 7</td>', 'This has a simple calm to it.  I like the soft blur of the clouds.  The danger sign adds a story to the shot.  Nice one. 7', '2011-07-15 15:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471575, 962180, 15711, '<td valign="top">You don''t typically think of Ben doing skies, yet I looked at his portfolio again and you are spot on.  I''m crazy for the clouds.  I love how it is almost the entire shot with a touch of land to ground it.  Good luck. 7</td>', 'You don''t typically think of Ben doing skies, yet I looked at his portfolio again and you are spot on.  I''m crazy for the clouds.  I love how it is almost the entire shot with a touch of land to ground it.  Good luck. 7', '2011-07-15 15:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471576, 962140, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that slight sense of grain, which Ben uses sometimes.  The minimalism strikes me, and that is one of his signatures.  Well done.  Good luck. 7</td>', 'I like that slight sense of grain, which Ben uses sometimes.  The minimalism strikes me, and that is one of his signatures.  Well done.  Good luck. 7', '2011-07-15 15:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471577, 962227, 15711, '<td valign="top">Not that it really matters, but he rarely uses that above and below frame that I love and use a lot myself. :)</td>', 'Not that it really matters, but he rarely uses that above and below frame that I love and use a lot myself. :)', '2011-07-15 15:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471581, 962330, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t think of Ben as having that squiggly blur and then <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=949004" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1371/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_949004.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1371/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_949004.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1371/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_949004.jpg"/></a> there it is.  I really like this and am coming back to comment. 7</td>', 'I don''t think of Ben as having that squiggly blur and then  there it is.  I really like this and am coming back to comment. 7', '2011-07-15 15:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471582, 962113, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!!!!  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Oh yes!!!!  I like this a lot.', '2011-07-15 15:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471584, 962155, 15711, '<td valign="top">The movement of the birds is great.  Like ghosts on the shore.  7</td>', 'The movement of the birds is great.  Like ghosts on the shore.  7', '2011-07-15 15:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471585, 962012, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is dreamy.  I love it.</td>', 'This is dreamy.  I love it.', '2011-07-15 15:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471596, 962124, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the hint of light on her jawline and nose.</td>', 'I love the hint of light on her jawline and nose.', '2011-07-15 15:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471597, 961881, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great use of contrast, light and shadow.  Looks like a Ben S for sure. 7</td>', 'Great use of contrast, light and shadow.  Looks like a Ben S for sure. 7', '2011-07-15 15:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471600, 962217, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the harsh contrasts.  Maybe not a typical blur shot he would do, but mostly certainly one of his other styles.  I like it. Your placement and composition is spot on. 7</td>', 'I like the harsh contrasts.  Maybe not a typical blur shot he would do, but mostly certainly one of his other styles.  I like it. Your placement and composition is spot on. 7', '2011-07-15 15:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471601, 961126, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s a Ben shot. :)</td>', 'Yep, that''s a Ben shot. :)', '2011-07-15 15:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471602, 961477, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  Love the title.</td>', 'ROFL  Love the title.', '2011-07-15 15:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471603, 962319, 15711, '<td valign="top">That hint of color and grain really speaks of Ben''s less "typical" work, which is great.  Good luck. :) 7</td>', 'That hint of color and grain really speaks of Ben''s less "typical" work, which is great.  Good luck. :) 7', '2011-07-15 15:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471604, 961779, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that she is almost a silhouette.  Lovely and wistful.  A tribute to Ben indeed. :)</td>', 'I like that she is almost a silhouette.  Lovely and wistful.  A tribute to Ben indeed. :)', '2011-07-15 15:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471605, 962259, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the hint of tilt.  The contrasts and softness work together.  Ben''s style indeed. :) 7</td>', 'I like the hint of tilt.  The contrasts and softness work together.  Ben''s style indeed. :) 7', '2011-07-15 15:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471606, 962292, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s as if she''s running with a ghost. Really cool. :)</td>', 'It''s as if she''s running with a ghost. Really cool. :)', '2011-07-15 15:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471607, 962175, 15711, '<td valign="top">A single shell amidst a softly blurred tide.  Yep - that''s Ben''s style. :) 7</td>', 'A single shell amidst a softly blurred tide.  Yep - that''s Ben''s style. :) 7', '2011-07-15 15:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471608, 962147, 15711, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this.  His use of shadow is really utilized here.  I love the single "spot light" on the skull.  Love the title too. 7</td>', 'I LOVE this.  His use of shadow is really utilized here.  I love the single "spot light" on the skull.  Love the title too. 7', '2011-07-15 15:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471611, 961933, 15711, '<td valign="top">I do like it and it''s certainly reminiscent of his work. :) 7</td>', 'I do like it and it''s certainly reminiscent of his work. :) 7', '2011-07-15 15:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471645, 962241, 68020, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is...but I love it! - 8</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is...but I love it! - 8', '2011-07-15 16:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471647, 962175, 68020, '<td valign="top">This is one of my two favorites of this challenge - Very serene - 9</td>', 'This is one of my two favorites of this challenge - Very serene - 9', '2011-07-15 16:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471660, 962321, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice shapes. I''m not totally convinced by the composition, but the emptiness has a nice texture to it.</td>', 'nice shapes. I''m not totally convinced by the composition, but the emptiness has a nice texture to it.', '2011-07-15 16:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471662, 962259, 50695, '<td valign="top">... for chocolate ice cream under 100 calories? good light and blur effect</td>', '... for chocolate ice cream under 100 calories? good light and blur effect', '2011-07-15 16:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471683, 962185, 50695, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2011-07-15 16:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471689, 962117, 50695, '<td valign="top">definitely spurgeony.</td>', 'definitely spurgeony.', '2011-07-15 16:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471711, 962056, 125275, '<td valign="top">Amen to your title!</td>', 'Amen to your title!', '2011-07-15 17:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471718, 961999, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like it a whole bunch; its got a smooth classic feel to it; terrific balance and flow. Nice work.</td>', 'I like it a whole bunch; its got a smooth classic feel to it; terrific balance and flow. Nice work.', '2011-07-15 17:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471719, 961582, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the lightheartedness of it; the sprinkler is nice.</td>', 'I like the lightheartedness of it; the sprinkler is nice.', '2011-07-15 17:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471720, 961587, 12611, '<td valign="top">Super; great lines and light- you caught the spirit without being obvious. excellent.</td>', 'Super; great lines and light- you caught the spirit without being obvious. excellent.', '2011-07-15 17:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471733, 962323, 69324, '<td valign="top">I personally would of cropped some of the dead space off of the right side.  That being said, I think you nailed the style dead on.</td>', 'I personally would of cropped some of the dead space off of the right side.  That being said, I think you nailed the style dead on.', '2011-07-15 17:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471736, 961999, 69324, '<td valign="top">Odd crop but it works here, bonus point for the title.</td>', 'Odd crop but it works here, bonus point for the title.', '2011-07-15 17:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471737, 961582, 69324, '<td valign="top">Docking you one for the clipped highlights, nice composition, 7.</td>', 'Docking you one for the clipped highlights, nice composition, 7.', '2011-07-15 18:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471740, 962292, 69324, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2011-07-15 18:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471743, 962313, 69324, '<td valign="top">Nice representation of the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice representation of the spirit of the challenge.', '2011-07-15 18:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471790, 961422, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like the way the structure comes in from many areas of the frame.</td>', 'I like the way the structure comes in from many areas of the frame.', '2011-07-15 19:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471791, 962319, 57447, '<td valign="top">This is special, well done.</td>', 'This is special, well done.', '2011-07-15 19:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471792, 962097, 57447, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2011-07-15 19:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471795, 961477, 57447, '<td valign="top">I remember that song.  Nice use of light and dark.</td>', 'I remember that song.  Nice use of light and dark.', '2011-07-15 19:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471796, 962091, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal placement in your frame.</td>', 'I like the diagonal placement in your frame.', '2011-07-15 19:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471857, 962296, 69324, '<td valign="top">The lone focus point on the bottom leaf makes the whole composition stand out,<br/>even though it may not be in the most desirable location of the image. Nice work.</td>', 'The lone focus point on the bottom leaf makes the whole composition stand out,even though it may not be in the most desirable location of the image. Nice work.', '2011-07-15 21:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471893, 961453, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite make heads or tails of this.  Appears to be only the shoulders of a man on the beach.  Odd.  Intriguing.  And odd.</td>', 'I can''t quite make heads or tails of this.  Appears to be only the shoulders of a man on the beach.  Odd.  Intriguing.  And odd.', '2011-07-15 23:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471894, 962169, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet!!  Essence of cat.</td>', 'Sweet!!  Essence of cat.', '2011-07-15 23:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471898, 962065, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has that sense of exploration that Ben is so good at capturing.</td>', 'Has that sense of exploration that Ben is so good at capturing.', '2011-07-15 23:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471899, 962320, 30982, '<td valign="top">Strikes me as a blend of a bit of bspurgeon and a good chunk of Posthumous.  Intriguing!</td>', 'Strikes me as a blend of a bit of bspurgeon and a good chunk of Posthumous.  Intriguing!', '2011-07-15 23:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471907, 961411, 76335, '<td valign="top">This evokes Ben, the teller of fairy tales. Sweet.</td>', 'This evokes Ben, the teller of fairy tales. Sweet.', '2011-07-15 23:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471908, 961477, 76335, '<td valign="top">They do seem to float. This is Ben by way of posthumous and pointandshoot. Great.</td>', 'They do seem to float. This is Ben by way of posthumous and pointandshoot. Great.', '2011-07-15 23:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471909, 961917, 76335, '<td valign="top">The savage side of one of Ben''s angelic daughters? Brutal yet sweet.</td>', 'The savage side of one of Ben''s angelic daughters? Brutal yet sweet.', '2011-07-15 23:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471911, 962097, 63218, '<td valign="top">Looked at this a long time. Became fascinated by the hairless mannequins &amp; the cafe crowd across the street, the traffic in the street. The Life in the street. At first I was impressed by the simple perfection of the black and white. After a while, it dawned on me that this is a Really Excellent Street Shot. Not an instant fav, because it took me a while to appreciate it. But definitely a fav. 10</td>', 'Looked at this a long time. Became fascinated by the hairless mannequins & the cafe crowd across the street, the traffic in the street. The Life in the street. At first I was impressed by the simple perfection of the black and white. After a while, it dawned on me that this is a Really Excellent Street Shot. Not an instant fav, because it took me a while to appreciate it. But definitely a fav. 10', '2011-07-15 23:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471912, 962248, 76335, '<td valign="top">I don''t have access to the Pacific Ocean either. So the pond will have to do. Bizarre energy here.</td>', 'I don''t have access to the Pacific Ocean either. So the pond will have to do. Bizarre energy here.', '2011-07-15 23:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471915, 961746, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice seascape (!). Ben should be so lucky to have access to a model such as this.</td>', 'Nice seascape (!). Ben should be so lucky to have access to a model such as this.', '2011-07-15 23:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471916, 961714, 76335, '<td valign="top">Water and wood are classic Spurgeon subjects. Very zen.</td>', 'Water and wood are classic Spurgeon subjects. Very zen.', '2011-07-15 23:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471918, 962234, 76335, '<td valign="top">A poem about childhood -- or perhaps, more specifically, girlhood. Beautifully converted.</td>', 'A poem about childhood -- or perhaps, more specifically, girlhood. Beautifully converted.', '2011-07-15 23:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471919, 962238, 76335, '<td valign="top">An endearing portrait -- something both you and Ben have in common.</td>', 'An endearing portrait -- something both you and Ben have in common.', '2011-07-15 23:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471921, 962296, 76335, '<td valign="top">Smeared vegetation. How fitting. I do like the sweeping energy here.</td>', 'Smeared vegetation. How fitting. I do like the sweeping energy here.', '2011-07-15 23:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471922, 962028, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the overlapping ghosts. The enigma of it all. One to explore. Wonderful.</td>', 'I love the overlapping ghosts. The enigma of it all. One to explore. Wonderful.', '2011-07-15 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471923, 962173, 76335, '<td valign="top">A beautiful study in textures. The sepia is fitting.</td>', 'A beautiful study in textures. The sepia is fitting.', '2011-07-15 23:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471926, 962328, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ben might have leveled that horizon. And then again, he might not have. I like the delicate balance of this.</td>', 'Ben might have leveled that horizon. And then again, he might not have. I like the delicate balance of this.', '2011-07-15 23:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471929, 962155, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the layers in this -- sky to earth. The ghostly sea birds add life. Nice conversion.</td>', 'I love the layers in this -- sky to earth. The ghostly sea birds add life. Nice conversion.', '2011-07-15 23:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471930, 961404, 76335, '<td valign="top">I see we met halfway! Again, I love the feeling that we''re slipping into dreams with her. And I imagine Ben does have a leather sofa.</td>', 'I see we met halfway! Again, I love the feeling that we''re slipping into dreams with her. And I imagine Ben does have a leather sofa.', '2011-07-15 23:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471932, 962217, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love that delicate flower, caught in a ray of sunshine, flourishing against the odds of darkness and decay all around.</td>', 'I love that delicate flower, caught in a ray of sunshine, flourishing against the odds of darkness and decay all around.', '2011-07-15 23:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471934, 962239, 76335, '<td valign="top">A beautifully graphic image with bold color -- the likes of which I can''t say I''ve seen Ben produce en masse. But maybe I''m not looking in the right places. This is stunning regardless.</td>', 'A beautifully graphic image with bold color -- the likes of which I can''t say I''ve seen Ben produce en masse. But maybe I''m not looking in the right places. This is stunning regardless.', '2011-07-15 23:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471936, 962185, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Ben-like eye candy here. I tease him for producing images like these, though this is quite beautiful.</td>', 'Wonderful Ben-like eye candy here. I tease him for producing images like these, though this is quite beautiful.', '2011-07-15 23:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471937, 962091, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the sharpness of that weed (?) against the backdrop of watery bokeh. The sepia -- yep, that''s Ben too.</td>', 'I love the sharpness of that weed (?) against the backdrop of watery bokeh. The sepia -- yep, that''s Ben too.', '2011-07-15 23:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471938, 962003, 76335, '<td valign="top">The greenish monochrome conversion is unline anything I''ve seen Ben do, but it works well here just the same.</td>', 'The greenish monochrome conversion is unline anything I''ve seen Ben do, but it works well here just the same.', '2011-07-15 23:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471939, 962064, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not the kind of blur I''d associate with Ben. This has a strange, psychedelic feel to it.</td>', 'Not the kind of blur I''d associate with Ben. This has a strange, psychedelic feel to it.', '2011-07-15 23:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471940, 961162, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is much rougher, and dare I say, much more real than the images I''ve seen of Ben''s girls on the beach. It almost feels like a sports play -- it has that much raw energy. I like it on its own terms.</td>', 'This is much rougher, and dare I say, much more real than the images I''ve seen of Ben''s girls on the beach. It almost feels like a sports play -- it has that much raw energy. I like it on its own terms.', '2011-07-15 23:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471941, 962078, 76335, '<td valign="top">Your conversion left some strange pink bands in the lower center of the image. That aside, this POV isn''t typical of Ben. It is nicely composed though.</td>', 'Your conversion left some strange pink bands in the lower center of the image. That aside, this POV isn''t typical of Ben. It is nicely composed though.', '2011-07-15 23:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471942, 961881, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve produced something that clearly acknowledges Ben''s influence without directly trying to copy him. That has some of Ben''s magic, but your own stamp. Nice.</td>', 'I like that you''ve produced something that clearly acknowledges Ben''s influence without directly trying to copy him. That has some of Ben''s magic, but your own stamp. Nice.', '2011-07-15 23:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471944, 961914, 76335, '<td valign="top">This could be the real thing! Very convincing in any case. I love the magic of this fleeting moment that you''ve captured.</td>', 'This could be the real thing! Very convincing in any case. I love the magic of this fleeting moment that you''ve captured.', '2011-07-15 23:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471945, 962124, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful the way her shadowy figure is situated against the rough geometry. The backlighting is perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful the way her shadowy figure is situated against the rough geometry. The backlighting is perfect.', '2011-07-15 23:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471946, 962321, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ben does have a knack for using water for the purposes of subject isolation in an unexpected way. This captures some of that. Beautiful.</td>', 'Ben does have a knack for using water for the purposes of subject isolation in an unexpected way. This captures some of that. Beautiful.', '2011-07-15 23:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471948, 962258, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love this in black and white. The textures are communicated in a more oblique way. Can''t say I''ve seen many of Ben''s bug shots, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'I love this in black and white. The textures are communicated in a more oblique way. Can''t say I''ve seen many of Ben''s bug shots, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2011-07-15 23:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471949, 962175, 76335, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured some of Ben''s sense of gravity here.</td>', 'You''ve captured some of Ben''s sense of gravity here.', '2011-07-15 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471950, 962297, 76335, '<td valign="top">He is in California, but I''m not sure he''s one of the Beverly Hillbillies. <br/> <br/>I like the ominous energy of your door.</td>', 'He is in California, but I''m not sure he''s one of the Beverly Hillbillies.  I like the ominous energy of your door.', '2011-07-15 23:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471953, 962117, 76335, '<td valign="top">One of a few shots, so far, that I think could be the real thing. This has the blurred water and the negative space too. It''s stunning.</td>', 'One of a few shots, so far, that I think could be the real thing. This has the blurred water and the negative space too. It''s stunning.', '2011-07-16 00:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471954, 962325, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the dance. The missing head. The crazy angle. Very fun. Ben will like it.</td>', 'I love the dance. The missing head. The crazy angle. Very fun. Ben will like it.', '2011-07-16 00:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471955, 962288, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the subject isolation here -- how the line between water and sky is blurred.</td>', 'I love the subject isolation here -- how the line between water and sky is blurred.', '2011-07-16 00:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471957, 961856, 76335, '<td valign="top">Feels fuzzy more than grainy, and poorly focused. Ben''s blur is a bit more carefully presented.</td>', 'Feels fuzzy more than grainy, and poorly focused. Ben''s blur is a bit more carefully presented.', '2011-07-16 00:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471960, 962180, 76335, '<td valign="top">A fairy tale sky. Ben is good with fairy tales.</td>', 'A fairy tale sky. Ben is good with fairy tales.', '2011-07-16 00:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471962, 961999, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love that these vessels are still afloat. Classic framing here. A real treat.</td>', 'I love that these vessels are still afloat. Classic framing here. A real treat.', '2011-07-16 00:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471965, 961730, 76335, '<td valign="top">Warm and intimate, like the best of Ben''s portraits.</td>', 'Warm and intimate, like the best of Ben''s portraits.', '2011-07-16 00:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471966, 961198, 76335, '<td valign="top">The madness of the play. Great use of blur to tell the story and bring us the action.</td>', 'The madness of the play. Great use of blur to tell the story and bring us the action.', '2011-07-16 00:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471969, 962330, 76335, '<td valign="top">So bleak and impenetrable, yet I can''t recover from its magic.</td>', 'So bleak and impenetrable, yet I can''t recover from its magic.', '2011-07-16 00:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471972, 961788, 76335, '<td valign="top">The beach, yes, that''s Ben. But your athlete looks strange, and I''m getting dizzy. We''ve left Ben behind. But that''s okay. I''m liking where this is going...</td>', 'The beach, yes, that''s Ben. But your athlete looks strange, and I''m getting dizzy. We''ve left Ben behind. But that''s okay. I''m liking where this is going...', '2011-07-16 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471973, 962238, 64086, '<td valign="top">Lovely shallow DOF and expression. My eye is drawn perfectly to the sharp bright eye. The dark eye provides such a nice contrast. Beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Lovely shallow DOF and expression. My eye is drawn perfectly to the sharp bright eye. The dark eye provides such a nice contrast. Beautiful portrait.', '2011-07-16 00:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471977, 962103, 113156, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and depth here.</td>', 'Very nice light and depth here.', '2011-07-16 00:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471979, 962113, 41337, '<td valign="top">There is something very spiritual and haunting about this.</td>', 'There is something very spiritual and haunting about this.', '2011-07-16 00:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471993, 961933, 50695, '<td valign="top">+1 for feet. well lensbabytwisted</td>', '+1 for feet. well lensbabytwisted', '2011-07-16 00:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472002, 962129, 50695, '<td valign="top">good composition with strong competing diagonals.</td>', 'good composition with strong competing diagonals.', '2011-07-16 01:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472010, 961915, 75713, '<td valign="top">Great textures and shapes and I like the light on the right middle column.  I am no expert on Ben''s body of work so no comment as to how it fits his style.  I do find some of the whites lack texture which might hurt your score but the interesting shape of the building and the angle you composed the shot from should make up for most of the points you could potentially lose for that. You had a difficult exposure challenge to overcome with the dark skies and the white tiles. I hope you do well.</td>', 'Great textures and shapes and I like the light on the right middle column.  I am no expert on Ben''s body of work so no comment as to how it fits his style.  I do find some of the whites lack texture which might hurt your score but the interesting shape of the building and the angle you composed the shot from should make up for most of the points you could potentially lose for that. You had a difficult exposure challenge to overcome with the dark skies and the white tiles. I hope you do well.', '2011-07-16 01:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472011, 962090, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice graceful lines.</td>', 'Nice graceful lines.', '2011-07-16 01:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472024, 962217, 68504, '<td valign="top">Grit, the play of light, and the near miss of the apparent subject create the balance and tension that is Ben''s.</td>', 'Grit, the play of light, and the near miss of the apparent subject create the balance and tension that is Ben''s.', '2011-07-16 01:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472027, 961162, 68504, '<td valign="top">Vibrant!  If this isn''t strictly Ben, it sure is a wonderful taking off.</td>', 'Vibrant!  If this isn''t strictly Ben, it sure is a wonderful taking off.', '2011-07-16 01:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472028, 962185, 68504, '<td valign="top">This has the calm authority of a Ben: the use of things and non-things to take us beyond a bivalent logic.</td>', 'This has the calm authority of a Ben: the use of things and non-things to take us beyond a bivalent logic.', '2011-07-16 01:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472029, 961126, 68504, '<td valign="top">Even the title is Bennish as well as the elements.</td>', 'Even the title is Bennish as well as the elements.', '2011-07-16 01:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472031, 961582, 68504, '<td valign="top">Delightful.  The simplicity is Ben''s, as well as the daring unheadedness.</td>', 'Delightful.  The simplicity is Ben''s, as well as the daring unheadedness.', '2011-07-16 01:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472032, 962313, 68504, '<td valign="top">I like this because I cannot put my finger on it - on neither the title whose resonance tantalizes me by being just out of hearing, nor a subject.  Like so much of Ben''s work, eluding the tight grasp.</td>', 'I like this because I cannot put my finger on it - on neither the title whose resonance tantalizes me by being just out of hearing, nor a subject.  Like so much of Ben''s work, eluding the tight grasp.', '2011-07-16 01:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472036, 962244, 68504, '<td valign="top">C''est bien serieux le petanquiste, peut-etre comme le Weimaraner de Ben.  Alors, je me demande, peut-il danser?</td>', 'C''est bien serieux le petanquiste, peut-etre comme le Weimaraner de Ben.  Alors, je me demande, peut-il danser?', '2011-07-16 02:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472037, 962305, 68504, '<td valign="top">Ah, a lovely splash that looks like hair trying things out on its own.</td>', 'Ah, a lovely splash that looks like hair trying things out on its own.', '2011-07-16 02:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472038, 962124, 68504, '<td valign="top">I love the subtlety of colour in the light and shadow; something is almost suggested, but not even that. An authoritative composition.</td>', 'I love the subtlety of colour in the light and shadow; something is almost suggested, but not even that. An authoritative composition.', '2011-07-16 02:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472039, 961763, 68504, '<td valign="top">audacious. I''m willing to listen to someone whose forehead is all eyebrow and knows a thing or two about hairstyle.</td>', 'audacious. I''m willing to listen to someone whose forehead is all eyebrow and knows a thing or two about hairstyle.', '2011-07-16 02:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472042, 962298, 68504, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this is fine, a feast. More like Melethia, perhaps, than Ben, but the same receptivity to Everything that is on offer to the eye that sees.</td>', 'Oh my, this is fine, a feast. More like Melethia, perhaps, than Ben, but the same receptivity to Everything that is on offer to the eye that sees.', '2011-07-16 02:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472043, 962214, 68504, '<td valign="top">Love the danger in the horizontal calm.  The gull fits in, unfazed.</td>', 'Love the danger in the horizontal calm.  The gull fits in, unfazed.', '2011-07-16 02:24:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6472049, 961915, 129727, '<td valign="top">One of his less attempted but very signature geometrically flowing shots. Cold steel. Very well done.</td>', 'One of his less attempted but very signature geometrically flowing shots. Cold steel. Very well done.', '2011-07-16 02:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472057, 962035, 113156, '<td valign="top">There is a serious risk of constipation eating to many of them buns, always go for wholemeal when you get the chance.<br/>I like the feeling of familiarity that this shot gives us, one of those neglected details of life, in your face and very zen.</td>', 'There is a serious risk of constipation eating to many of them buns, always go for wholemeal when you get the chance.I like the feeling of familiarity that this shot gives us, one of those neglected details of life, in your face and very zen.', '2011-07-16 03:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472082, 961076, 55883, '<td valign="top">Not voting I''m afraid, but this is absolutely beautiful! Really well done</td>', 'Not voting I''m afraid, but this is absolutely beautiful! Really well done', '2011-07-16 06:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472084, 962080, 119747, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blur, processing also does him justice as well, I think. 7</td>', 'Beautiful blur, processing also does him justice as well, I think. 7', '2011-07-16 07:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472085, 962113, 119747, '<td valign="top">My favourite so far in the challenge, I think it matches his type of image where there is not too much blur, but there''s enough for it to be interesting. 8</td>', 'My favourite so far in the challenge, I think it matches his type of image where there is not too much blur, but there''s enough for it to be interesting. 8', '2011-07-16 07:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472086, 961885, 119747, '<td valign="top">Close, but IMO I think it''s a bit clean to be one of ben''s, maybe if there were more drama in some way (clouds, moving birds etc). Still, nice image - 6</td>', 'Close, but IMO I think it''s a bit clean to be one of ben''s, maybe if there were more drama in some way (clouds, moving birds etc). Still, nice image - 6', '2011-07-16 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472087, 962005, 119747, '<td valign="top">One of the best I''ve seen so far, captures his style nicely. If it was a bit more contrasty it might have helped - 7</td>', 'One of the best I''ve seen so far, captures his style nicely. If it was a bit more contrasty it might have helped - 7', '2011-07-16 07:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472089, 961582, 119747, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! I might even have a guess and say this is ben''s, but I still haven''t seen the rest of the images. 8</td>', 'This is fantastic! I might even have a guess and say this is ben''s, but I still haven''t seen the rest of the images. 8', '2011-07-16 07:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472090, 962097, 119747, '<td valign="top">Brilliant work - 8</td>', 'Brilliant work - 8', '2011-07-16 07:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472091, 962129, 119747, '<td valign="top">I think you''ll get voted down here because Ben isn''t famous for his macros, don''t be put off though because it is a great macro.</td>', 'I think you''ll get voted down here because Ben isn''t famous for his macros, don''t be put off though because it is a great macro.', '2011-07-16 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472092, 961126, 119747, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, could it be bens?! 8</td>', 'Lovely image, could it be bens?! 8', '2011-07-16 07:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472093, 961999, 119747, '<td valign="top">Brilliant processing on a great image. 7</td>', 'Brilliant processing on a great image. 7', '2011-07-16 07:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472094, 962140, 119747, '<td valign="top">Brilliant image! don''t think it is perfect bspurgeon but on its own a wonderfil image. 8</td>', 'Brilliant image! don''t think it is perfect bspurgeon but on its own a wonderfil image. 8', '2011-07-16 07:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472095, 962298, 119747, '<td valign="top">I love that the man at the top right is in focus. 77</td>', 'I love that the man at the top right is in focus. 77', '2011-07-16 07:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472096, 961422, 119747, '<td valign="top">one of my highest scores yet, nicely replicates him. 8</td>', 'one of my highest scores yet, nicely replicates him. 8', '2011-07-16 07:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472098, 962012, 119747, '<td valign="top">I think this could be Ben? 8</td>', 'I think this could be Ben? 8', '2011-07-16 07:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472103, 961757, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is really wonderful, front page for me.</td>', 'This is really wonderful, front page for me.', '2011-07-16 08:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472104, 961191, 114285, '<td valign="top">Gripping stuff.</td>', 'Gripping stuff.', '2011-07-16 08:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472105, 962330, 114285, '<td valign="top">Now this is real Ben material.</td>', 'Now this is real Ben material.', '2011-07-16 08:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472106, 961404, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pic, and really meets the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful pic, and really meets the challenge.', '2011-07-16 08:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472112, 961730, 135204, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing her innocence and beauty.</td>', 'Great job capturing her innocence and beauty.', '2011-07-16 08:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472115, 962108, 135204, '<td valign="top">Really like your composition in this one.</td>', 'Really like your composition in this one.', '2011-07-16 08:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472117, 962228, 135204, '<td valign="top">For me this is very much in the style of bspurgeon.</td>', 'For me this is very much in the style of bspurgeon.', '2011-07-16 08:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472118, 962319, 135204, '<td valign="top">The slash of blue is wonderful.</td>', 'The slash of blue is wonderful.', '2011-07-16 08:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472119, 962098, 135204, '<td valign="top">Great B/W conversion, and some good blur :)</td>', 'Great B/W conversion, and some good blur :)', '2011-07-16 08:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472124, 961450, 135204, '<td valign="top">Wow, truly a work of art.  Lots of emotion in this one.</td>', 'Wow, truly a work of art.  Lots of emotion in this one.', '2011-07-16 08:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472125, 961788, 135204, '<td valign="top">The beach, the blur, the grain, I think you got all the bspurgeon hallmarks.</td>', 'The beach, the blur, the grain, I think you got all the bspurgeon hallmarks.', '2011-07-16 08:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472127, 962073, 135204, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.</td>', 'Simple but effective.', '2011-07-16 08:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472132, 962239, 135204, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between nature and mankind and kudos for entering a colour picture in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice contrast between nature and mankind and kudos for entering a colour picture in this challenge.', '2011-07-16 08:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472134, 962189, 135204, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot.</td>', 'Great candid shot.', '2011-07-16 08:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472135, 962041, 135204, '<td valign="top">Great use of an unconventional perspective.</td>', 'Great use of an unconventional perspective.', '2011-07-16 08:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472136, 962124, 135204, '<td valign="top">Really like your use of light and shadow.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Really like your use of light and shadow.  One of my top picks.', '2011-07-16 08:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472137, 962292, 135204, '<td valign="top">Very nice motion.</td>', 'Very nice motion.', '2011-07-16 08:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472139, 962310, 135204, '<td valign="top">Nice emotion in this one, but for me it would be even better if the two people in the background were not there.</td>', 'Nice emotion in this one, but for me it would be even better if the two people in the background were not there.', '2011-07-16 08:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472140, 962113, 64086, '<td valign="top">I love how the shadows flow on to the beach. Beautiful and dreamlike. My only nit is that I think the figure on the left edge detracts from the composition.</td>', 'I love how the shadows flow on to the beach. Beautiful and dreamlike. My only nit is that I think the figure on the left edge detracts from the composition.', '2011-07-16 09:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472141, 962217, 135204, '<td valign="top">Love the ray of light on the flower.  Truly great shot and the high contrast B/W works great here.</td>', 'Love the ray of light on the flower.  Truly great shot and the high contrast B/W works great here.', '2011-07-16 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472156, 961404, 135204, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a beautiful girl.</td>', 'Great shot of a beautiful girl.', '2011-07-16 10:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472158, 961757, 135204, '<td valign="top">Dreamy.  Love the water blur.</td>', 'Dreamy.  Love the water blur.', '2011-07-16 10:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472160, 962101, 135204, '<td valign="top">Great mood.</td>', 'Great mood.', '2011-07-16 10:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472162, 961582, 135204, '<td valign="top">Love this one.</td>', 'Love this one.', '2011-07-16 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472163, 962056, 135204, '<td valign="top">Great caption and a cool shot too.</td>', 'Great caption and a cool shot too.', '2011-07-16 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472164, 962089, 135204, '<td valign="top">Looks very bspurgeon to me.</td>', 'Looks very bspurgeon to me.', '2011-07-16 10:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472166, 961517, 135204, '<td valign="top">Not really sure how a picture of those two is in the style of bspurgeon.</td>', 'Not really sure how a picture of those two is in the style of bspurgeon.', '2011-07-16 10:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472167, 961881, 135204, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and compostion.</td>', 'Nice pose and compostion.', '2011-07-16 11:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472169, 961076, 135204, '<td valign="top">Love the rainbow colours.</td>', 'Love the rainbow colours.', '2011-07-16 11:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472170, 962234, 135204, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing eyes.</td>', 'Wow, amazing eyes.', '2011-07-16 11:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472171, 962180, 135204, '<td valign="top">Amazing cloudscape.</td>', 'Amazing cloudscape.', '2011-07-16 11:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472173, 961856, 135204, '<td valign="top">Love the mood in this shot.</td>', 'Love the mood in this shot.', '2011-07-16 11:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472178, 961447, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love the pun. The marginal framing reminds me of some of Ben''s recent shots.</td>', 'Love the pun. The marginal framing reminds me of some of Ben''s recent shots.', '2011-07-16 11:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472180, 962214, 76335, '<td valign="top">Irony at the beach. Ben knows a thing or two about beaches, and he''s been know to conjure up some pretty good irony too. I love how your model is looking back...</td>', 'Irony at the beach. Ben knows a thing or two about beaches, and he''s been know to conjure up some pretty good irony too. I love how your model is looking back...', '2011-07-16 11:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472181, 962012, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like how this glows. The funny feet are something Our Man Spurgeon wouldn''t think twice about working into his composition.</td>', 'I like how this glows. The funny feet are something Our Man Spurgeon wouldn''t think twice about working into his composition.', '2011-07-16 11:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472182, 961811, 76335, '<td valign="top">Perfect title. Looks like a pinhole experiment -- one of Ben''s (and my) favorite things to do.</td>', 'Perfect title. Looks like a pinhole experiment -- one of Ben''s (and my) favorite things to do.', '2011-07-16 11:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472183, 962123, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the motion of the background and the wildness of her hair. Feel very natural.</td>', 'I like the motion of the background and the wildness of her hair. Feel very natural.', '2011-07-16 11:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472184, 961450, 76335, '<td valign="top">Haunting. Damn near terrifying. There''s something telling about that white dress against all that Spurgeon Sepia.</td>', 'Haunting. Damn near terrifying. There''s something telling about that white dress against all that Spurgeon Sepia.', '2011-07-16 11:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472185, 961165, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and good use of thirds. A simple and quiet image that invites the viewer''s attention but doesn''t demand it.</td>', 'Beautifully composed and good use of thirds. A simple and quiet image that invites the viewer''s attention but doesn''t demand it.', '2011-07-16 11:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472187, 962327, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ben''s no stranger to presenting good textures, but rarely have I seen him do it to such chilling effect. Nice.</td>', 'Ben''s no stranger to presenting good textures, but rarely have I seen him do it to such chilling effect. Nice.', '2011-07-16 11:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472188, 962218, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fantastic subject isolation. The bokeh is hypnotic.</td>', 'Fantastic subject isolation. The bokeh is hypnotic.', '2011-07-16 11:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472189, 962320, 76335, '<td valign="top">You and Ben make good dancing partners. This will be one of my top picks for sure.</td>', 'You and Ben make good dancing partners. This will be one of my top picks for sure.', '2011-07-16 11:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472190, 961182, 76335, '<td valign="top">Blurifying. I can only imagine where this parade is headed.</td>', 'Blurifying. I can only imagine where this parade is headed.', '2011-07-16 11:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472193, 962232, 76335, '<td valign="top">Appealing to Ben''s use of subtelty here. No eyepopping contrast, no tack sharp edges. This is a beautiful still life.</td>', 'Appealing to Ben''s use of subtelty here. No eyepopping contrast, no tack sharp edges. This is a beautiful still life.', '2011-07-16 11:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472195, 962313, 76335, '<td valign="top">A fitting poetic title for a classic Ben theme.</td>', 'A fitting poetic title for a classic Ben theme.', '2011-07-16 11:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472196, 962215, 76335, '<td valign="top">California politics? I guess it all works the same. Very engaging.</td>', 'California politics? I guess it all works the same. Very engaging.', '2011-07-16 11:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472197, 962307, 76335, '<td valign="top">Thematically it''s a bit baffling, but it''s a creative use of reflection and layers.</td>', 'Thematically it''s a bit baffling, but it''s a creative use of reflection and layers.', '2011-07-16 11:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472199, 962256, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the outstretched arms of the chair. Ben''s portraits are inviting like that.</td>', 'I love the outstretched arms of the chair. Ben''s portraits are inviting like that.', '2011-07-16 11:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472201, 961130, 76335, '<td valign="top">Funny how a little bit of camera movement brings wicked life to an ordinary scene. Ben caught on to this from the get go.</td>', 'Funny how a little bit of camera movement brings wicked life to an ordinary scene. Ben caught on to this from the get go.', '2011-07-16 11:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472204, 962145, 76335, '<td valign="top">This starts with Ben but goes way beyond. The beautifully structured harbor swept away by a wayward cyclist. Quirky. Great.</td>', 'This starts with Ben but goes way beyond. The beautifully structured harbor swept away by a wayward cyclist. Quirky. Great.', '2011-07-16 11:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472205, 962104, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ben does like his gadgets (!).</td>', 'Ben does like his gadgets (!).', '2011-07-16 11:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472206, 962098, 76335, '<td valign="top">I did something very similar at an airport last year. Table as tripod? I do like how your subject is isolated against the busy goings-on.</td>', 'I did something very similar at an airport last year. Table as tripod? I do like how your subject is isolated against the busy goings-on.', '2011-07-16 11:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472207, 962246, 76335, '<td valign="top">Indeed. Looks like she''s taking off into the forest! Unhappily ever after?</td>', 'Indeed. Looks like she''s taking off into the forest! Unhappily ever after?', '2011-07-16 11:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472208, 961159, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Ben is good at capturing the sea in all its power and majesty. And this is that.</td>', 'Fantastic. Ben is good at capturing the sea in all its power and majesty. And this is that.', '2011-07-16 11:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472211, 962123, 100831, '<td valign="top">The first thing that strikes me about this is the sense of her moving through the frame. I love the long flowing hair and the hint of a smile but her eyes - that look of love me now, catch me while you can - they sparkle with life. Nice Ben entry.</td>', 'The first thing that strikes me about this is the sense of her moving through the frame. I love the long flowing hair and the hint of a smile but her eyes - that look of love me now, catch me while you can - they sparkle with life. Nice Ben entry.', '2011-07-16 11:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472214, 962062, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love that you reduced this to the midtones. Ben (in fact, most) might have cranked up the contrast. But your fleeting would have been less fleetive in that case (huh?). <br/> <br/>This starts with Ben but ends with you. I like it.</td>', 'I love that you reduced this to the midtones. Ben (in fact, most) might have cranked up the contrast. But your fleeting would have been less fleetive in that case (huh?).  This starts with Ben but ends with you. I like it.', '2011-07-16 12:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472215, 962292, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fantastic energy. The figure on the right seems to be struggling to keep up.</td>', 'Fantastic energy. The figure on the right seems to be struggling to keep up.', '2011-07-16 12:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472216, 961513, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail in this. Love the lurking shadow and the feeling of stealth, intrusion.</td>', 'Wonderful detail in this. Love the lurking shadow and the feeling of stealth, intrusion.', '2011-07-16 12:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472218, 961929, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the sidelong glance, and, yes, the treatment is typical bspurgeon. But you didn''t have to tell me (or anyone) that.</td>', 'I like the sidelong glance, and, yes, the treatment is typical bspurgeon. But you didn''t have to tell me (or anyone) that.', '2011-07-16 12:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472235, 962162, 100831, '<td valign="top">Marvelous!!! This has just the right bit of softness and story appeal. Excellent entry for the challenge - I''ve been back a few times to view this again.</td>', 'Marvelous!!! This has just the right bit of softness and story appeal. Excellent entry for the challenge - I''ve been back a few times to view this again.', '2011-07-16 12:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472240, 962015, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love is touchy like that. Love the nervous energy here.</td>', 'Love is touchy like that. Love the nervous energy here.', '2011-07-16 12:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472253, 962256, 11854, '<td valign="top">Oh, happy days! Kids make the shot, no matter what anyone else says!</td>', 'Oh, happy days! Kids make the shot, no matter what anyone else says!', '2011-07-16 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472254, 962129, 11854, '<td valign="top">He''s looking mighty prominent to me! LOL!</td>', 'He''s looking mighty prominent to me! LOL!', '2011-07-16 13:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472259, 961881, 11854, '<td valign="top">Cue the Jaws theme music, I feel impending doom is coming from that darkness.</td>', 'Cue the Jaws theme music, I feel impending doom is coming from that darkness.', '2011-07-16 13:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472260, 961517, 11854, '<td valign="top">Howdy!</td>', 'Howdy!', '2011-07-16 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472261, 962241, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2011-07-16 13:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472262, 962327, 11854, '<td valign="top">Awesome texture!</td>', 'Awesome texture!', '2011-07-16 13:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472264, 962215, 11854, '<td valign="top">Yep, or chicken feet. Does it really matter? 10</td>', 'Yep, or chicken feet. Does it really matter? 10', '2011-07-16 13:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472265, 961933, 11854, '<td valign="top">What saucy fun!</td>', 'What saucy fun!', '2011-07-16 13:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472266, 962288, 11854, '<td valign="top">LOL! It looks like he''s sinking! I''ve never seen a water bird swim so low in the water. What a catch!</td>', 'LOL! It looks like he''s sinking! I''ve never seen a water bird swim so low in the water. What a catch!', '2011-07-16 13:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
