(6472296, 962147, 50695, '<td valign="top">a sheep<br/>of infinite jest, of most excellent fancy: he hath<br/>borne me on his back a thousand times; and now, how<br/>abhorred in my imagination it is! my gorge rims at<br/>it. Here hung those lips that I have kissed I know<br/>not how oft. Where be your baas now? your<br/>gambols? your bleats? your flashes of merriment,<br/>that were wont to set the barnyard on a roar? Not one<br/>now, to mock your own grinning? quite chap-fallen?<br/>Now get you to my lady''s chamber, and tell her, let<br/>her paint an inch thick, to this favour she must<br/>come; make her laugh at that.</td>', 'a sheepof infinite jest, of most excellent fancy: he hathborne me on his back a thousand times; and now, howabhorred in my imagination it is! my gorge rims atit. Here hung those lips that I have kissed I knownot how oft. Where be your baas now? yourgambols? your bleats? your flashes of merriment,that were wont to set the barnyard on a roar? Not onenow, to mock your own grinning? quite chap-fallen?Now get you to my lady''s chamber, and tell her, lether paint an inch thick, to this favour she mustcome; make her laugh at that.', '2011-07-16 14:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
