(6472532, 961782, 126709, '<td valign="top">I have the feeling of looking down on the clouds from some great building.  Nice.</td>', 'I have the feeling of looking down on the clouds from some great building.  Nice.', '2011-07-16 16:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
