(6472542, 962028, 126709, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection..  Works well with the title.</td>', 'Nice reflection..  Works well with the title.', '2011-07-16 16:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472544, 962293, 124815, '<td valign="top">I am mesmerized by this landscape. The ground is almost anthropomorphic - reminds me of a battle scene  of the German painter Altdorfer, The Alexander Battle<br/><a href="//www.//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Albrecht_Altdorfer,_The_Battle_of_Alexander_at_Issus.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Albrecht_Altdorfer,_The_Battle_of_Alexander_at_Issus.jpg</a> <br/>Therefore, I do not think of it as a picture in the style of Ben but a great picture on its own.</td>', 'I am mesmerized by this landscape. The ground is almost anthropomorphic - reminds me of a battle scene  of the German painter Altdorfer, The Alexander Battle//www.//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Albrecht_Altdorfer,_The_Battle_of_Alexander_at_Issus.jpg Therefore, I do not think of it as a picture in the style of Ben but a great picture on its own.', '2011-07-16 16:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472550, 962097, 124815, '<td valign="top">I find this very good. The entire story, the ignored messenger, the Woody Allen type a bit freaked out, the hustle and bustle .... Perhaps I find this image very familiar to me - an ubiquitous scene around Times Square in Manhattan - but a familiar scene does not make a good shot.<br/>Congratulations for a great candid.</td>', 'I find this very good. The entire story, the ignored messenger, the Woody Allen type a bit freaked out, the hustle and bustle .... Perhaps I find this image very familiar to me - an ubiquitous scene around Times Square in Manhattan - but a familiar scene does not make a good shot.Congratulations for a great candid.', '2011-07-16 17:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472552, 962214, 124815, '<td valign="top">A classic good shot. In the style of Ben? Perhaps not exactly. Save for the subject and the sky. But a fine photograph.</td>', 'A classic good shot. In the style of Ben? Perhaps not exactly. Save for the subject and the sky. But a fine photograph.', '2011-07-16 17:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472557, 961453, 124815, '<td valign="top">Must say that I do not think that Ben frames his shots, especially the dreamy, nostalgic ones. The man seems too big for the scene. The shot is fine but the elements do not form a coherent image IMHO.</td>', 'Must say that I do not think that Ben frames his shots, especially the dreamy, nostalgic ones. The man seems too big for the scene. The shot is fine but the elements do not form a coherent image IMHO.', '2011-07-16 17:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472565, 962228, 124815, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha, great title for the Buddhist in Ben''s! Very, very clever. The image though does not convince me, even if it''s his.Perhaps the background is too dark ... perhaps the reeds do not flow with the wind ....<br/>A good point for the approach.</td>', 'Ha, ha, great title for the Buddhist in Ben''s! Very, very clever. The image though does not convince me, even if it''s his.Perhaps the background is too dark ... perhaps the reeds do not flow with the wind ....A good point for the approach.', '2011-07-16 17:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472569, 962091, 124815, '<td valign="top">That''s one for Ben, not of his though.</td>', 'That''s one for Ben, not of his though.', '2011-07-16 17:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472580, 961885, 124815, '<td valign="top">I think that the quote made me guess the author, (some living near Montenegro, although the image could have been taken in southern France as well), but that''s a trivial point. <br/>I like it very much. It is a robust image that  has violence and tenderness in the same time, some qualities that I personally appreciate in Ben''s work.<br/>A very fine shot indeed.</td>', 'I think that the quote made me guess the author, (some living near Montenegro, although the image could have been taken in southern France as well), but that''s a trivial point. I like it very much. It is a robust image that  has violence and tenderness in the same time, some qualities that I personally appreciate in Ben''s work.A very fine shot indeed.', '2011-07-16 17:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472582, 961724, 124815, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful.</td>', 'Just beautiful.', '2011-07-16 17:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472584, 961477, 124815, '<td valign="top">A splendid shot indeed! I love the movement - the piglets seem more like dancing in the round - the serenity and the whole geometry of this picture.</td>', 'A splendid shot indeed! I love the movement - the piglets seem more like dancing in the round - the serenity and the whole geometry of this picture.', '2011-07-16 17:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472588, 962162, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is a true candid and funny shot soaked in the childhood tenderness. I love the little boy on the left of the image and if it wasn''t for his leg, I would have cropped the two adults in the picture. Adorable.</td>', 'This is a true candid and funny shot soaked in the childhood tenderness. I love the little boy on the left of the image and if it wasn''t for his leg, I would have cropped the two adults in the picture. Adorable.', '2011-07-16 17:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472591, 962108, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Yes, the emotion is visible. I can picture also a wooden old table top and a small glass of red wine with fingerprints on it. But that''s another story.</td>', 'Very nice. Yes, the emotion is visible. I can picture also a wooden old table top and a small glass of red wine with fingerprints on it. But that''s another story.', '2011-07-16 17:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472593, 962217, 124815, '<td valign="top">It surely works for me. Perhaps a little too blunt for Ben''s style, but a very tragic and endearing image in its own. I suspect the photographer''s identity and I just shake his hand.</td>', 'It surely works for me. Perhaps a little too blunt for Ben''s style, but a very tragic and endearing image in its own. I suspect the photographer''s identity and I just shake his hand.', '2011-07-16 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472597, 962026, 124815, '<td valign="top">Totally irresistible! Congratulatons.</td>', 'Totally irresistible! Congratulatons.', '2011-07-16 17:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472598, 961513, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is such a great picture ... I wished that the cat would have moved its head just so slightly ... but then where would be the mystery, the candid feeling? Very nice.</td>', 'This is such a great picture ... I wished that the cat would have moved its head just so slightly ... but then where would be the mystery, the candid feeling? Very nice.', '2011-07-16 17:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472599, 961447, 64086, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo. I can feel the weather. The 3 fish are puzzling and fascinating.</td>', 'Wonderful photo. I can feel the weather. The 3 fish are puzzling and fascinating.', '2011-07-16 17:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472600, 962063, 124815, '<td valign="top">I shouldn''t like it since it takes such a toll on my (our) eyes ... but I do like it for all its light feeling and humour.</td>', 'I shouldn''t like it since it takes such a toll on my (our) eyes ... but I do like it for all its light feeling and humour.', '2011-07-16 17:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472603, 962113, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. It has some flavor of the Orient, of faraway places, foreign smells and unheard before whispers. A very fine picture.</td>', 'Nice shot. It has some flavor of the Orient, of faraway places, foreign smells and unheard before whispers. A very fine picture.', '2011-07-16 17:57:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6472606, 962299, 64086, '<td valign="top">Lovely portait, shadows and lighting, the unusual shapes in the background and such a serious expression. My only minor criticism is I feel that the object in the background next to the nose interferes with the composition a bit.</td>', 'Lovely portait, shadows and lighting, the unusual shapes in the background and such a serious expression. My only minor criticism is I feel that the object in the background next to the nose interferes with the composition a bit.', '2011-07-16 17:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472610, 961191, 124815, '<td valign="top">A very powerful picture of all the fear of childhood. But I feel that it was too much worked on and it lost the candid quality, that all the trebling was not there and just added - I think that I do not make myself too clear. But I like this shot a lot though and for the boy''s little sweaty hands I keep it for a long time in front of me.</td>', 'A very powerful picture of all the fear of childhood. But I feel that it was too much worked on and it lost the candid quality, that all the trebling was not there and just added - I think that I do not make myself too clear. But I like this shot a lot though and for the boy''s little sweaty hands I keep it for a long time in front of me.', '2011-07-16 18:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472611, 962033, 124815, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s a beautiful mystery! My first thought was that the figure on the left is a monk hiding the recipe of the ambrosian liquor that he makes from the fruit of an unknown weed (a true story of the chartreuse liqueur).<br/>Must say that I have a fondness for a picture that makes me think immediately of a story, or make one, or reminds me of a smell or a painting or an unknown longing. This is one of them, and there were a few in this challenge, as befitting its "theme".</td>', 'Oh, that''s a beautiful mystery! My first thought was that the figure on the left is a monk hiding the recipe of the ambrosian liquor that he makes from the fruit of an unknown weed (a true story of the chartreuse liqueur).Must say that I have a fondness for a picture that makes me think immediately of a story, or make one, or reminds me of a smell or a painting or an unknown longing. This is one of them, and there were a few in this challenge, as befitting its "theme".', '2011-07-16 18:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472612, 962307, 124815, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Excellent title. (Unhappy border).<br/>A fine shot.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Excellent title. (Unhappy border).A fine shot.', '2011-07-16 18:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472613, 962215, 124815, '<td valign="top">I wished I thought of this one and taken it!</td>', 'I wished I thought of this one and taken it!', '2011-07-16 18:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472616, 962020, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the smile (on my face too). (not voting)</td>', 'I like the smile (on my face too). (not voting)', '2011-07-16 18:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472619, 961513, 22459, '<td valign="top">Don''t let it in, they always make a mess. By the way great image.</td>', 'Don''t let it in, they always make a mess. By the way great image.', '2011-07-16 18:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472624, 961447, 22459, '<td valign="top">Brilliant image, straight into my fav''s.</td>', 'Brilliant image, straight into my fav''s.', '2011-07-16 18:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472628, 961999, 61396, '<td valign="top">Thanks for letting me go wild with this: I like your attitude with the framing and the low angle. The scene looks like it was extracted from 50''s. I also think the kid caught you in action (did he?). (not voting)</td>', 'Thanks for letting me go wild with this: I like your attitude with the framing and the low angle. The scene looks like it was extracted from 50''s. I also think the kid caught you in action (did he?). (not voting)', '2011-07-16 19:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472641, 962000, 64086, '<td valign="top">Reaching across the water, ingrained with texture, shadow and memories. Some dreams washed away, others remain.  Fascinating vision.</td>', 'Reaching across the water, ingrained with texture, shadow and memories. Some dreams washed away, others remain.  Fascinating vision.', '2011-07-16 19:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472645, 962140, 64086, '<td valign="top">Beautiful transition to nothing. Thanks for the ride.</td>', 'Beautiful transition to nothing. Thanks for the ride.', '2011-07-16 19:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472646, 962073, 64086, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed lines. Love the darkness, the drop of brightness and how it evolves from shadowy, abstract shapes on the left to the concrete leafy texture bathed in beautiful light on the right side.</td>', 'Nicely composed lines. Love the darkness, the drop of brightness and how it evolves from shadowy, abstract shapes on the left to the concrete leafy texture bathed in beautiful light on the right side.', '2011-07-16 19:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472647, 961885, 75713, '<td valign="top">Ohh I love these old buildings.  The bird in the sky adds an extra point of interest as well.  I am no expert on Ben''s work so I will not comment on that aspect of your photo  - sorry :(  However, excellent choice of B&amp;W, great shadows and textures galore.  The tilt/lean of the towers really add to the composition and I like the tall banks behind as there is so much detail in them. The slight vignette works well.  Well seen and photographed.</td>', 'Ohh I love these old buildings.  The bird in the sky adds an extra point of interest as well.  I am no expert on Ben''s work so I will not comment on that aspect of your photo  - sorry :(  However, excellent choice of B&W, great shadows and textures galore.  The tilt/lean of the towers really add to the composition and I like the tall banks behind as there is so much detail in them. The slight vignette works well.  Well seen and photographed.', '2011-07-16 19:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472648, 962080, 64086, '<td valign="top">Beautiful strokes of light with a grain and motion that I can almost reach out and touch, but it slips from my view in the blink of an eye.</td>', 'Beautiful strokes of light with a grain and motion that I can almost reach out and touch, but it slips from my view in the blink of an eye.', '2011-07-16 19:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472651, 962041, 64086, '<td valign="top">Well seen and nicely framed.</td>', 'Well seen and nicely framed.', '2011-07-16 19:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472653, 962256, 75713, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful child and a great model to boot!  I like the softness and the way her hair is gently blowing to one side.  I am no expert on Ben''s work so I will not try to draw a comparison other than you both have precious children in your people shots. One tiny quibble is I find the arms of the chair are so white and so wide that they do take my eye away from the child.  I wonder if cropping it tight on the right (her left) side might have kept her more the focal point but again, that is just a matter of personal preference and you would have lost that interesting object (old bridge/pier?) Good job not blowing out the water.  Nicely done.</td>', 'What a beautiful child and a great model to boot!  I like the softness and the way her hair is gently blowing to one side.  I am no expert on Ben''s work so I will not try to draw a comparison other than you both have precious children in your people shots. One tiny quibble is I find the arms of the chair are so white and so wide that they do take my eye away from the child.  I wonder if cropping it tight on the right (her left) side might have kept her more the focal point but again, that is just a matter of personal preference and you would have lost that interesting object (old bridge/pier?) Good job not blowing out the water.  Nicely done.', '2011-07-16 19:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472654, 961757, 64086, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the warm stone and the cool waters.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the warm stone and the cool waters.', '2011-07-16 19:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472656, 962325, 64086, '<td valign="top">The joys of childhood.</td>', 'The joys of childhood.', '2011-07-16 19:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472657, 961757, 75713, '<td valign="top">Color!  And such beautiful color too!  Beautiful hues and I love the quality of the water.  Great job getting it so silky given how bright it is.  I love the people (children?) on the cliff - they turn this shot into a story.  The wet rocks shine in the light and the varying colors please the eye.  I don''t know Ben''s work well enough to compare the style but hope you do very well with this beautiful shot.</td>', 'Color!  And such beautiful color too!  Beautiful hues and I love the quality of the water.  Great job getting it so silky given how bright it is.  I love the people (children?) on the cliff - they turn this shot into a story.  The wet rocks shine in the light and the varying colors please the eye.  I don''t know Ben''s work well enough to compare the style but hope you do very well with this beautiful shot.', '2011-07-16 19:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472659, 962098, 109353, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. I really like the contrasts, the perspective and the ghosts. The (discret) rhythm is strong and makes clean an almost overloaded picture.</td>', 'Awesome shot. I really like the contrasts, the perspective and the ghosts. The (discret) rhythm is strong and makes clean an almost overloaded picture.', '2011-07-16 19:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472660, 962326, 75713, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful abstract!  It looks like a woman''s gown being tossed about in the water or the curtain coming down on a wonderful ballroom dancer. I don''t know enough about Ben''s work to compare styles so I won''t try to do so. However, the shapes and tonal quality gives my brain license to come up with all sorts of scenarios which is something I love when viewing these types of shots.  Just spectacular - I hope you do very well with this!</td>', 'What a wonderful abstract!  It looks like a woman''s gown being tossed about in the water or the curtain coming down on a wonderful ballroom dancer. I don''t know enough about Ben''s work to compare styles so I won''t try to do so. However, the shapes and tonal quality gives my brain license to come up with all sorts of scenarios which is something I love when viewing these types of shots.  Just spectacular - I hope you do very well with this!', '2011-07-16 19:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472662, 962003, 75713, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about Ben''s work to compare styles so I won''t try to do so. What a great find - poor little ladybug has had such a climb that I hope there is something good waiting for it at the top and not the beak of some hungry bird. Wonderful b/g and a great job of having it so crisp I can see the tiny bits of the stem.  Good luck!</td>', 'I don''t know enough about Ben''s work to compare styles so I won''t try to do so. What a great find - poor little ladybug has had such a climb that I hope there is something good waiting for it at the top and not the beak of some hungry bird. Wonderful b/g and a great job of having it so crisp I can see the tiny bits of the stem.  Good luck!', '2011-07-16 19:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472665, 961182, 75713, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about Ben''s work to compare styles so I won''t try to do so. <br/> <br/>This evokes an image in my mind of an aerial view of Stonehenge. What a great shot - interesting textures and a wonderful range of tonal qualities. This should do very well ... Good Luck!</td>', 'I don''t know enough about Ben''s work to compare styles so I won''t try to do so.  This evokes an image in my mind of an aerial view of Stonehenge. What a great shot - interesting textures and a wonderful range of tonal qualities. This should do very well ... Good Luck!', '2011-07-16 19:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472679, 962065, 100831, '<td valign="top">squish squish... love the tones and the sentiment, and how the emphasis is clearly on the toes!!</td>', 'squish squish... love the tones and the sentiment, and how the emphasis is clearly on the toes!!', '2011-07-16 20:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472680, 961447, 100831, '<td valign="top">Ha!! The most apt picture in the challenge, I do believe. Well done tones and contrast. He looks so proud!</td>', 'Ha!! The most apt picture in the challenge, I do believe. Well done tones and contrast. He looks so proud!', '2011-07-16 20:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472696, 961191, 109353, '<td valign="top">Lovely creepy feeling from this shot. I love the sharpness of this blur (?!)</td>', 'Lovely creepy feeling from this shot. I love the sharpness of this blur (?!)', '2011-07-16 21:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472697, 962297, 96983, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast and dizzying motion.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast and dizzying motion.', '2011-07-16 21:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472698, 961788, 109353, '<td valign="top">Perfect inspiration from my favourite part of Ben''s work! Composition and contrasts are powerful ... excellent work !</td>', 'Perfect inspiration from my favourite part of Ben''s work! Composition and contrasts are powerful ... excellent work !', '2011-07-16 21:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472699, 962145, 109353, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite in this challenge. This is a very compelling picture...</td>', 'One of my favourite in this challenge. This is a very compelling picture...', '2011-07-16 21:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472701, 962089, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Beautiful motion! 9</td>', 'Back to comment... Beautiful motion! 9', '2011-07-16 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472702, 962140, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... <br/> <br/>And when that fog horn blows I will be coming home<br/>And when the fog horn blows I want to hear it<br/>I don''t have to fear it<br/> <br/>And I want to rock your gypsy soul<br/>Just like way back in the days of old<br/>And magnificently we will flow into the mystic<br/> <br/>It''s always good when an image makes song lyrics pop into my head. ;D</td>', 'Back to comment...  And when that fog horn blows I will be coming homeAnd when the fog horn blows I want to hear itI don''t have to fear it And I want to rock your gypsy soulJust like way back in the days of oldAnd magnificently we will flow into the mystic It''s always good when an image makes song lyrics pop into my head. ;D', '2011-07-16 21:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472703, 962104, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Isn''t technology grand?! LOL! Cool shot!</td>', 'Back to comment... Isn''t technology grand?! LOL! Cool shot!', '2011-07-16 21:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472704, 961447, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Plus points for the humor! LOL!</td>', 'Back to comment... Plus points for the humor! LOL!', '2011-07-16 21:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472705, 962041, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Hey! Is someone missing a shoe? LOL!</td>', 'Back to comment... Hey! Is someone missing a shoe? LOL!', '2011-07-16 21:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472706, 961730, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Aawwww! Gorgeous light on this beautiful face. 9</td>', 'Back to comment... Aawwww! Gorgeous light on this beautiful face. 9', '2011-07-16 21:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472707, 962036, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... This is too bizarre for words! 9</td>', 'Back to comment... This is too bizarre for words! 9', '2011-07-16 21:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472708, 962104, 109353, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept, very well exectuted !</td>', 'Excellent concept, very well exectuted !', '2011-07-16 21:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472709, 961477, 11854, '<td valign="top">I wish I had taken this picture.</td>', 'I wish I had taken this picture.', '2011-07-16 21:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472710, 962217, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Oh! What beautiful light! Love the processing too! 9</td>', 'Back to comment... Oh! What beautiful light! Love the processing too! 9', '2011-07-16 21:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472711, 962155, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Lovely vision!</td>', 'Back to comment... Lovely vision!', '2011-07-16 21:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472712, 962065, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Kids &amp; beaches, they go together! LOL! Nice bit of blur to add interest. 9</td>', 'Back to comment... Kids & beaches, they go together! LOL! Nice bit of blur to add interest. 9', '2011-07-16 21:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472713, 961086, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Puss in boots? LOL! Love the high key processing. 9</td>', 'Back to comment... Puss in boots? LOL! Love the high key processing. 9', '2011-07-16 21:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472714, 962026, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... I love when an image looks mirrored, yet you know it isn''t. This is wonderful, something I would love to have taken. Bumping to 10</td>', 'Back to comment... I love when an image looks mirrored, yet you know it isn''t. This is wonderful, something I would love to have taken. Bumping to 10', '2011-07-16 21:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472715, 962005, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Angelina, ballerina. So sweet!</td>', 'Back to comment... Angelina, ballerina. So sweet!', '2011-07-16 21:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472716, 961833, 11854, '<td valign="top">Badly in need of a shave I''m afraid, and maybe some dermabrasion.</td>', 'Badly in need of a shave I''m afraid, and maybe some dermabrasion.', '2011-07-16 21:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472717, 962000, 11854, '<td valign="top">Back to comment... Quite cryptic!</td>', 'Back to comment... Quite cryptic!', '2011-07-16 21:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472743, 962153, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOL Are you speaking of the ribbon?  No way, my friend.  This is nice.  7</td>', 'LOL Are you speaking of the ribbon?  No way, my friend.  This is nice.  7', '2011-07-16 22:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472744, 962218, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yep, surely looks like one of Ben''s.</td>', 'Yep, surely looks like one of Ben''s.', '2011-07-16 22:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472745, 962003, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love those polka dotted wings. :)</td>', 'Love those polka dotted wings. :)', '2011-07-16 22:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472746, 961831, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of it.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of it.', '2011-07-16 22:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472747, 961182, 15711, '<td valign="top">Your title is so cool, I''m upping your score. :)</td>', 'Your title is so cool, I''m upping your score. :)', '2011-07-16 22:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
