(6472763, 962104, 75713, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know Ben''s style well enough to draw comparisons so I am just going to comment on your photo to the best of abilities -  sorry :( <br/> <br/>When I opened your shot to full view I just went wow .. it''s quite a feat and technically very well done. The complete opposite of the top of the shot as far as focus goes is amazing and very creative.  I imagine you are scoring very high with this one ... Good Luck (but you don''t need it)</td>', 'I really don''t know Ben''s style well enough to draw comparisons so I am just going to comment on your photo to the best of abilities -  sorry :(  When I opened your shot to full view I just went wow .. it''s quite a feat and technically very well done. The complete opposite of the top of the shot as far as focus goes is amazing and very creative.  I imagine you are scoring very high with this one ... Good Luck (but you don''t need it)', '2011-07-16 22:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
