(6472769, 962307, 75713, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know Ben''s style well enough to draw comparisons so I am just going to comment on your photo to the best of abilities -  sorry :( <br/> <br/>With that said I just want to say that I find this shot creative, ethereal, whimsical and a joy to look at.  Looks like an old log cabin with plank floors, a wonderful fireplace with a rocking chair to rock away the cares of the day.  Yes, I love making up stories to go with photos.  This shot should score very well and I wish you luck even though you don''t need it.</td>', 'I really don''t know Ben''s style well enough to draw comparisons so I am just going to comment on your photo to the best of abilities -  sorry :(  With that said I just want to say that I find this shot creative, ethereal, whimsical and a joy to look at.  Looks like an old log cabin with plank floors, a wonderful fireplace with a rocking chair to rock away the cares of the day.  Yes, I love making up stories to go with photos.  This shot should score very well and I wish you luck even though you don''t need it.', '2011-07-16 22:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
