(6472925, 962033, 68504, '<td valign="top">I am taking this very personally. The dark shape on the left is either a monk or a nun, skirting the clearing, having long forsworn that berry bad colour which you so brazenly brandish.  I''m sorry - "I''m sorry" is my fabourite comment - but I am offended that you insist on bringing this up.</td>', 'I am taking this very personally. The dark shape on the left is either a monk or a nun, skirting the clearing, having long forsworn that berry bad colour which you so brazenly brandish.  I''m sorry - "I''m sorry" is my fabourite comment - but I am offended that you insist on bringing this up.', '2011-07-17 02:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472927, 962296, 68504, '<td valign="top">it is so nice to be held</td>', 'it is so nice to be held', '2011-07-17 02:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472930, 962028, 30214, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if this is Ben''s style, but I like the strangeness of this</td>', 'I am not sure if this is Ben''s style, but I like the strangeness of this', '2011-07-17 02:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472933, 962123, 30214, '<td valign="top">lovely portrait of a beautiful girl. Ben has some of those, although I would not associate them with his signature style</td>', 'lovely portrait of a beautiful girl. Ben has some of those, although I would not associate them with his signature style', '2011-07-17 02:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472937, 962313, 30214, '<td valign="top">beautiful bokeh! I would possibly crop out the other sharp piece in the upper right, the rest is lovely, and worthy of Ben''s work.</td>', 'beautiful bokeh! I would possibly crop out the other sharp piece in the upper right, the rest is lovely, and worthy of Ben''s work.', '2011-07-17 02:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472943, 961477, 68504, '<td valign="top">damn right</td>', 'damn right', '2011-07-17 02:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472944, 962185, 30214, '<td valign="top">beautiful tones. reminds me of Ben''s work (but I think he would tilt it somehow :))</td>', 'beautiful tones. reminds me of Ben''s work (but I think he would tilt it somehow :))', '2011-07-17 02:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472950, 961811, 30214, '<td valign="top">Ben extreme! :) great work.</td>', 'Ben extreme! :) great work.', '2011-07-17 02:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472957, 962113, 68504, '<td valign="top">OMG there''s Ben crouching over his tripod!  You win! Very classy.</td>', 'OMG there''s Ben crouching over his tripod!  You win! Very classy.', '2011-07-17 02:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472960, 962175, 30214, '<td valign="top">excellent work! Just one thing, I think Ben might crop it differently, with less sky and more foreground sand</td>', 'excellent work! Just one thing, I think Ben might crop it differently, with less sky and more foreground sand', '2011-07-17 02:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472962, 961404, 30214, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2011-07-17 02:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472964, 962298, 30214, '<td valign="top">excellent street shot. Love the surprise of the man</td>', 'excellent street shot. Love the surprise of the man', '2011-07-17 02:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472965, 962037, 30214, '<td valign="top">this is fantastic. I think Ben would love to have taken this</td>', 'this is fantastic. I think Ben would love to have taken this', '2011-07-17 02:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472966, 961477, 30214, '<td valign="top">fantastic work. Reminds me something which I cannot quite place. Perhaps, Giacomelli''s monks?</td>', 'fantastic work. Reminds me something which I cannot quite place. Perhaps, Giacomelli''s monks?', '2011-07-17 02:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472967, 962117, 30214, '<td valign="top">very bspurgeonly</td>', 'very bspurgeonly', '2011-07-17 02:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472969, 961447, 11769, '<td valign="top">But you may be a Bspurgeon. That hand holding the fishing pole at the upper left is genius. Great composition. I can feel the salty air.</td>', 'But you may be a Bspurgeon. That hand holding the fishing pole at the upper left is genius. Great composition. I can feel the salty air.', '2011-07-17 02:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472973, 962152, 59737, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred if the bird was flying towards you or to the side to get a view of the head, good entry for style of bspurgeon.</td>', 'I would have preferred if the bird was flying towards you or to the side to get a view of the head, good entry for style of bspurgeon.', '2011-07-17 02:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472974, 962176, 59737, '<td valign="top">good use of blur, like how some of the horse is in sharper focus, I also like the graininess that I see, nice range of tones on this.</td>', 'good use of blur, like how some of the horse is in sharper focus, I also like the graininess that I see, nice range of tones on this.', '2011-07-17 02:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472975, 961746, 59737, '<td valign="top">don''t think Ben has done artistic nude but this has the slow shutter and blur that he''d likely use if he did.</td>', 'don''t think Ben has done artistic nude but this has the slow shutter and blur that he''d likely use if he did.', '2011-07-17 02:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6472991, 962238, 59737, '<td valign="top">nicely exposed and processed, fits the challenge, little bit of softness and movement</td>', 'nicely exposed and processed, fits the challenge, little bit of softness and movement', '2011-07-17 04:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473075, 962189, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the concentrated look of your model. Ben''s portraits often make us part of the converstaion like this. The pinkish tones are a nice response to Ben''s sepia.</td>', 'I like the concentrated look of your model. Ben''s portraits often make us part of the converstaion like this. The pinkish tones are a nice response to Ben''s sepia.', '2011-07-17 11:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473076, 962005, 76335, '<td valign="top">Grass <i>and</i> legs -- two for the price of one. I like the harmony between the two.</td>', 'Grass and legs -- two for the price of one. I like the harmony between the two.', '2011-07-17 11:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473077, 962129, 76335, '<td valign="top">Textures and thirds. A pleasing composition. Intriguing subject matter. Nice black and white conversion. It''s all there.</td>', 'Textures and thirds. A pleasing composition. Intriguing subject matter. Nice black and white conversion. It''s all there.', '2011-07-17 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473078, 962323, 76335, '<td valign="top">The blur is a little more shaky than what we usually see from Ben. I like your title.</td>', 'The blur is a little more shaky than what we usually see from Ben. I like your title.', '2011-07-17 11:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473079, 962176, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quite fascinating. The heavy charcoal blacks just barely manage to outline your out-of-control subject. I love the raw energy of this.</td>', 'Quite fascinating. The heavy charcoal blacks just barely manage to outline your out-of-control subject. I love the raw energy of this.', '2011-07-17 11:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473081, 962298, 76335, '<td valign="top">We''re certainly in Ben''s neighborhood. I love the tangled mass of moving legs and feet -- the single seated lady, the puppy... <br/> <br/>This will be high on my list.</td>', 'We''re certainly in Ben''s neighborhood. I love the tangled mass of moving legs and feet -- the single seated lady, the puppy...  This will be high on my list.', '2011-07-17 11:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473082, 962097, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the use of blur to suggest activity. I do wish some of the subjects were engaged in something more interesting.</td>', 'I like the use of blur to suggest activity. I do wish some of the subjects were engaged in something more interesting.', '2011-07-17 11:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473083, 962244, 76335, '<td valign="top">A fascinating maze of a portrait. An environmental portrait, yes?</td>', 'A fascinating maze of a portrait. An environmental portrait, yes?', '2011-07-17 11:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473095, 962101, 76335, '<td valign="top">It is foreboding. I like how the lightpole seems to anchor the scene. Seems like it should be lit -- further adding to the ominous mood.</td>', 'It is foreboding. I like how the lightpole seems to anchor the scene. Seems like it should be lit -- further adding to the ominous mood.', '2011-07-17 12:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473099, 962247, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light play, the more I look the more I see. Hard to tell if good or evil forces are at work here...</td>', 'Wonderful light play, the more I look the more I see. Hard to tell if good or evil forces are at work here...', '2011-07-17 12:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473100, 962063, 76335, '<td valign="top">When the mundane turns sisnister... I think I''ll have the salad.</td>', 'When the mundane turns sisnister... I think I''ll have the salad.', '2011-07-17 12:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473110, 961991, 76335, '<td valign="top">Here''s an interesting and unexpeted sort of candid. A little more troubling than the sugary portraits of Ben''s girls we''re used to seeing. That''s not a criticism of either -- rather both build their magic based on what the subject and scene have to offer. I should add that I rather like the faded (desaturated) tones in this.</td>', 'Here''s an interesting and unexpeted sort of candid. A little more troubling than the sugary portraits of Ben''s girls we''re used to seeing. That''s not a criticism of either -- rather both build their magic based on what the subject and scene have to offer. I should add that I rather like the faded (desaturated) tones in this.', '2011-07-17 13:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473112, 962326, 66384, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite make out what this is. Looks like a woman in a long dress trying to get up off the ground, with a flock of sheep in the background. I like the tone and find the image intriguing.</td>', 'I can''t quite make out what this is. Looks like a woman in a long dress trying to get up off the ground, with a flock of sheep in the background. I like the tone and find the image intriguing.', '2011-07-17 13:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473114, 962238, 66384, '<td valign="top">Pretty lighting and beautiful eye. Sweet face.</td>', 'Pretty lighting and beautiful eye. Sweet face.', '2011-07-17 13:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473116, 962033, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''ve not see Ben much use selective desat, but I can hardly claim to have studied his entire oeuvre. As these things go, this is a thoughtful and tasteful application of it.</td>', 'I''ve not see Ben much use selective desat, but I can hardly claim to have studied his entire oeuvre. As these things go, this is a thoughtful and tasteful application of it.', '2011-07-17 13:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473117, 962140, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the empty space, ant the balance you achieved by placing the subject so far into the corner.</td>', 'Love the empty space, ant the balance you achieved by placing the subject so far into the corner.', '2011-07-17 13:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473118, 962070, 76335, '<td valign="top">Strange and disturbing. I''m trying to figure out the pattern -- chain link? One worthy of a second look.</td>', 'Strange and disturbing. I''m trying to figure out the pattern -- chain link? One worthy of a second look.', '2011-07-17 13:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473121, 962319, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the tone and little touch of color.  Very dreamy.</td>', 'Love the tone and little touch of color.  Very dreamy.', '2011-07-17 13:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473123, 962260, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ben has a thing for limbs, I think. This feels incomplete, but it''s my unwillingness to engage. I''ll have to come back to it...</td>', 'Ben has a thing for limbs, I think. This feels incomplete, but it''s my unwillingness to engage. I''ll have to come back to it...', '2011-07-17 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473124, 962319, 76335, '<td valign="top">An apparition on a cloud. The blue is enchanting. <br/> <br/>Inspired by Ben, maybe, but it''s your own creative vision -- a unique one -- that''s responsible for the end result. I think that''s really what this challenge is all about.</td>', 'An apparition on a cloud. The blue is enchanting.  Inspired by Ben, maybe, but it''s your own creative vision -- a unique one -- that''s responsible for the end result. I think that''s really what this challenge is all about.', '2011-07-17 13:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473125, 961885, 66384, '<td valign="top">Terrific strength in this image. I love the way the bird brings life and spirit to the stone towers.</td>', 'Terrific strength in this image. I love the way the bird brings life and spirit to the stone towers.', '2011-07-17 13:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473129, 962234, 66384, '<td valign="top">She is so lovely and graceful. I really the movement in this, and I think the light is wonderful.</td>', 'She is so lovely and graceful. I really the movement in this, and I think the light is wonderful.', '2011-07-17 13:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473132, 962323, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this very interesting effect -- not a straight forward motion blur. I curious to know how you achieved this -- perhaps by moving the camera as the subjects were also moving. I like the tone too.</td>', 'I like this very interesting effect -- not a straight forward motion blur. I curious to know how you achieved this -- perhaps by moving the camera as the subjects were also moving. I like the tone too.', '2011-07-17 13:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473139, 962026, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice rhythm in the stripes, and nice capture of what looks like a tender moment. Although i think this image is about the stripes, for me, the contrast is just a little too strong -- I strain to make out the faces of the zebras.</td>', 'Nice rhythm in the stripes, and nice capture of what looks like a tender moment. Although i think this image is about the stripes, for me, the contrast is just a little too strong -- I strain to make out the faces of the zebras.', '2011-07-17 13:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473140, 962260, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and the sketchy feel of this image. It reminds me of a study in an artist''s sketch book.</td>', 'I like the lines and the sketchy feel of this image. It reminds me of a study in an artist''s sketch book.', '2011-07-17 14:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473143, 961411, 66384, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this beautiful rather haunting image. She appears to be a bride, and this creates so many questions: why is she alone; why is she spoiling her wedding dress; what is she planning ...?</td>', 'I keep coming back to this beautiful rather haunting image. She appears to be a bride, and this creates so many questions: why is she alone; why is she spoiling her wedding dress; what is she planning ...?', '2011-07-17 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473146, 961831, 66384, '<td valign="top">I just love this image. The light and contrast are beautiful, and the feather is so soft and graceful.</td>', 'I just love this image. The light and contrast are beautiful, and the feather is so soft and graceful.', '2011-07-17 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473148, 961944, 66384, '<td valign="top">Oh what a tangled web we weave. I might have called it "Deception". :)</td>', 'Oh what a tangled web we weave. I might have called it "Deception". :)', '2011-07-17 14:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473149, 962180, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, indeed!</td>', 'Very dramatic, indeed!', '2011-07-17 14:20:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6473150, 962258, 66384, '<td valign="top"><u></u></td>', '', '2011-07-17 14:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473153, 962056, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well, I like it. I like the framing, the light and shadows, the colors, the movement, and the hint of a story.</td>', 'Well, I like it. I like the framing, the light and shadows, the colors, the movement, and the hint of a story.', '2011-07-17 14:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473158, 961447, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is such an old fashion image. The subject is someone out of an adventure novel. Terrific capture, and I really like the sepia tone.</td>', 'This is such an old fashion image. The subject is someone out of an adventure novel. Terrific capture, and I really like the sepia tone.', '2011-07-17 14:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473161, 962124, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the light and the color. Since I can''t see the girl''s face, I''m wondering if the the image might be more powerful with her looking out the window.</td>', 'I like the composition, the light and the color. Since I can''t see the girl''s face, I''m wondering if the the image might be more powerful with her looking out the window.', '2011-07-17 14:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473163, 962293, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a dramatic shot and place.</td>', 'Wow, what a dramatic shot and place.', '2011-07-17 14:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473167, 961714, 66384, '<td valign="top">This title makes me sad. I think my husband, who is struggling with his memory, must be feeling this way. And this simple image is an interesting representation of a pretty, peaceful, non-distinct memory.</td>', 'This title makes me sad. I think my husband, who is struggling with his memory, must be feeling this way. And this simple image is an interesting representation of a pretty, peaceful, non-distinct memory.', '2011-07-17 14:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473168, 962012, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The bare feet reaching for the cool water, and the light on the rocks and little plant. I would like to be those feet.</td>', 'I really like this. The bare feet reaching for the cool water, and the light on the rocks and little plant. I would like to be those feet.', '2011-07-17 15:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473169, 962313, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love the painterly brush stroke bokeh. Wonderful capture of natures beauty that captures the spirit of Ben''s style.</td>', 'Love the painterly brush stroke bokeh. Wonderful capture of natures beauty that captures the spirit of Ben''s style.', '2011-07-17 15:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473171, 961929, 11769, '<td valign="top">Topicality aside lovely blurred image.</td>', 'Topicality aside lovely blurred image.', '2011-07-17 15:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473173, 962036, 11769, '<td valign="top">Jumping on that little trampoline is priceless.</td>', 'Jumping on that little trampoline is priceless.', '2011-07-17 15:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473179, 961914, 11769, '<td valign="top">Emotionally charged perfect moment captured. If not Ben someone who understands.</td>', 'Emotionally charged perfect moment captured. If not Ben someone who understands.', '2011-07-17 15:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473199, 962113, 11769, '<td valign="top">Mysterious happenings on the shore. Beautiful exposure, blur.</td>', 'Mysterious happenings on the shore. Beautiful exposure, blur.', '2011-07-17 15:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473200, 962175, 11769, '<td valign="top">Clean perfection.</td>', 'Clean perfection.', '2011-07-17 15:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473201, 962319, 11769, '<td valign="top">Like a pastel drawing.</td>', 'Like a pastel drawing.', '2011-07-17 15:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473202, 961856, 104230, '<td valign="top">Ha! Funny thing, I am voting on this challenge when I should be preparing for my upcoming cello lesson!  I find this interesting.  I like the light coming in from the side, and the head turned away.  Those plus the sheet music on the stand provide a left to right flow across the image.  But the position of the cello seems really unnatural. I don''t recall seeing many ?any players holding their cello like this, even during periods when they are not playing, and it''s difficult not to let that affect my reaction to the image.  Overall, it''s an  evocative picture. I like the soft feel and the slight graininess.</td>', 'Ha! Funny thing, I am voting on this challenge when I should be preparing for my upcoming cello lesson!  I find this interesting.  I like the light coming in from the side, and the head turned away.  Those plus the sheet music on the stand provide a left to right flow across the image.  But the position of the cello seems really unnatural. I don''t recall seeing many ?any players holding their cello like this, even during periods when they are not playing, and it''s difficult not to let that affect my reaction to the image.  Overall, it''s an  evocative picture. I like the soft feel and the slight graininess.', '2011-07-17 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473204, 962117, 11769, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the foam waves create.</td>', 'Good capture of the foam waves create.', '2011-07-17 15:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473205, 962326, 11769, '<td valign="top">A wonderful creation.</td>', 'A wonderful creation.', '2011-07-17 15:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473206, 961724, 11769, '<td valign="top">I love images this blurred. Nice stuff.</td>', 'I love images this blurred. Nice stuff.', '2011-07-17 15:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473207, 962296, 11769, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of a stormy day. Very dreamy.</td>', 'Makes me think of a stormy day. Very dreamy.', '2011-07-17 16:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473208, 961477, 11769, '<td valign="top">Ha! Those little one''s are so precious. Great image.</td>', 'Ha! Those little one''s are so precious. Great image.', '2011-07-17 16:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473211, 962140, 11769, '<td valign="top">Like traveling into the unknown, unfathomable. Gorgeous.</td>', 'Like traveling into the unknown, unfathomable. Gorgeous.', '2011-07-17 16:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473212, 961191, 11769, '<td valign="top">Captures a certain sadness.</td>', 'Captures a certain sadness.', '2011-07-17 16:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473213, 962323, 11769, '<td valign="top">Like the title and the guys hat.</td>', 'Like the title and the guys hat.', '2011-07-17 16:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473214, 961811, 11769, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful. Wonderful take on the challenge.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful. Wonderful take on the challenge.', '2011-07-17 16:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473215, 962307, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wow! Love it.</td>', 'Wow! Love it.', '2011-07-17 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473216, 962292, 11769, '<td valign="top">Brings a smile to my face, adorable.</td>', 'Brings a smile to my face, adorable.', '2011-07-17 16:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473217, 962065, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wonderful stuff, great perspective.</td>', 'Wonderful stuff, great perspective.', '2011-07-17 16:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473220, 962324, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love that light.</td>', 'Love that light.', '2011-07-17 16:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473222, 962000, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love the hand shadow. Very creative work.</td>', 'Love the hand shadow. Very creative work.', '2011-07-17 16:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473225, 962259, 11769, '<td valign="top">Something we seem to do a lot of in a lifetime. Great light.</td>', 'Something we seem to do a lot of in a lifetime. Great light.', '2011-07-17 16:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473226, 962012, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love the humor.</td>', 'Love the humor.', '2011-07-17 16:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473237, 961587, 76335, '<td valign="top">Appealing to Ben''s love of the abstract... If this is the jail, I''m curious about the prisoner. Creative.</td>', 'Appealing to Ben''s love of the abstract... If this is the jail, I''m curious about the prisoner. Creative.', '2011-07-17 17:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473238, 962088, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice mood, and I like the sepia.</td>', 'Nice mood, and I like the sepia.', '2011-07-17 17:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473240, 961971, 76335, '<td valign="top">A novel point of view turns a bicycle into a strange spacecraft.</td>', 'A novel point of view turns a bicycle into a strange spacecraft.', '2011-07-17 17:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473241, 962073, 76335, '<td valign="top">This feels a bit too sharp, but the composition and conversion are both nicely done.</td>', 'This feels a bit too sharp, but the composition and conversion are both nicely done.', '2011-07-17 17:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473247, 961835, 76335, '<td valign="top">The building alone, with all its polyrhythm, would have been impressive enough. The figure creeping in from the edges is a daring touch. Nice conversion too, I might add.</td>', 'The building alone, with all its polyrhythm, would have been impressive enough. The figure creeping in from the edges is a daring touch. Nice conversion too, I might add.', '2011-07-17 17:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473248, 961086, 66384, '<td valign="top">The rotation creates an odd effect, that makes me look longer. I like the softness of it, and the relaxation.</td>', 'The rotation creates an odd effect, that makes me look longer. I like the softness of it, and the relaxation.', '2011-07-17 17:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473253, 962265, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ben''s no stranger to days at the park. This feels like a Sunday. Casual and fun and quite nice in black and white.</td>', 'Ben''s no stranger to days at the park. This feels like a Sunday. Casual and fun and quite nice in black and white.', '2011-07-17 17:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473257, 961742, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like you were working with challenging (bright) lighting. Still, you managed a long enough shutter to pull some of the butterfly''s energy into your image. I like the duotone here.</td>', 'Looks like you were working with challenging (bright) lighting. Still, you managed a long enough shutter to pull some of the butterfly''s energy into your image. I like the duotone here.', '2011-07-17 17:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473260, 961782, 76335, '<td valign="top">Building and sky actually have a lot in common in this image. They seem to mutually enhance each other. An excellent composition. (You had great light too.)</td>', 'Building and sky actually have a lot in common in this image. They seem to mutually enhance each other. An excellent composition. (You had great light too.)', '2011-07-17 17:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473261, 961757, 76335, '<td valign="top">I suspect Ben would have done this in black and white -- but Ben''s done everything at least once. This is impressive, and the tones are so appealing, I think I want to go there now. <br/> <br/>(As an aside, I actually almost titled my image this. I didn''t though. You''re welcome.)</td>', 'I suspect Ben would have done this in black and white -- but Ben''s done everything at least once. This is impressive, and the tones are so appealing, I think I want to go there now.  (As an aside, I actually almost titled my image this. I didn''t though. You''re welcome.)', '2011-07-17 17:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473264, 962294, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for flowers in black and white. Their colors almost always steal the show, so it takes a good black and white image (such as this) to show off their complex form and delicate textures. Great work with the composition and especially the light.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for flowers in black and white. Their colors almost always steal the show, so it takes a good black and white image (such as this) to show off their complex form and delicate textures. Great work with the composition and especially the light.', '2011-07-17 17:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
