(6473937, 962234, 124815, '<td valign="top">The power of the girl''s gaze is spectacular. I don''t think of Ben''s shots here but it''s a trivial matter since I am absorbed by the moment. I think I have a clue of who is the photographer (this is not a candid shot but made by an experienced one) but again, I am too taken by this frozen moment in time. Great shot.</td>', 'The power of the girl''s gaze is spectacular. I don''t think of Ben''s shots here but it''s a trivial matter since I am absorbed by the moment. I think I have a clue of who is the photographer (this is not a candid shot but made by an experienced one) but again, I am too taken by this frozen moment in time. Great shot.', '2011-07-18 05:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473940, 962326, 124815, '<td valign="top">A deeply disturbing shot that made me revisit it a few times. each time that I spin a different tale I am stopped by a different element in the picture. So, it must be a missing clue here. Yes, there is some missing in it, or too blurred. a bit of too much awkwardness perhaps. Nevertheless, a picture that asks to be revisited is a GOOD one.</td>', 'A deeply disturbing shot that made me revisit it a few times. each time that I spin a different tale I am stopped by a different element in the picture. So, it must be a missing clue here. Yes, there is some missing in it, or too blurred. a bit of too much awkwardness perhaps. Nevertheless, a picture that asks to be revisited is a GOOD one.', '2011-07-18 05:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473941, 961582, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice. I did expect a shot like this for sure.</td>', 'Nice. I did expect a shot like this for sure.', '2011-07-18 05:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473943, 961742, 124815, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful color in this shot. An entire summer day in front of me.</td>', 'What a beautiful color in this shot. An entire summer day in front of me.', '2011-07-18 05:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473944, 962104, 124815, '<td valign="top">Good stuff</td>', 'Good stuff', '2011-07-18 05:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473945, 961944, 124815, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Even without the title. I''d like to spin my own tale. <br/>How sturdy the silk is and how lost we can get in its gossamer armor...</td>', 'Great shot. Even without the title. I''d like to spin my own tale. How sturdy the silk is and how lost we can get in its gossamer armor...', '2011-07-18 05:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473946, 962330, 124815, '<td valign="top">In the manner of Turner, shot in B&amp;W. It surely is a compliment.</td>', 'In the manner of Turner, shot in B&W. It surely is a compliment.', '2011-07-18 05:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473947, 961587, 124815, '<td valign="top">Yes, nothing more frightening than freedom. Or so I read it. The jail seems almost cozy for outside it is LIFE.<br/>Good stuff here. Fermenting thoughts.</td>', 'Yes, nothing more frightening than freedom. Or so I read it. The jail seems almost cozy for outside it is LIFE.Good stuff here. Fermenting thoughts.', '2011-07-18 05:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473948, 962101, 124815, '<td valign="top">Yes, frightening and no light at the end.</td>', 'Yes, frightening and no light at the end.', '2011-07-18 05:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473949, 962065, 124815, '<td valign="top">As expected, pattering of little feet.</td>', 'As expected, pattering of little feet.', '2011-07-18 05:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473950, 962259, 124815, '<td valign="top">Good. With a good measure of panic.</td>', 'Good. With a good measure of panic.', '2011-07-18 05:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473951, 961831, 124815, '<td valign="top">Irresistibly delicious! No matter in which challenge. A fairy tale.</td>', 'Irresistibly delicious! No matter in which challenge. A fairy tale.', '2011-07-18 05:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473952, 961782, 124815, '<td valign="top">A taste of the world above. Simply beautiful.</td>', 'A taste of the world above. Simply beautiful.', '2011-07-18 05:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473954, 961447, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nope. But I can taste the salt on my lips and smell the sea in the air. Has the flavor of old times pictures.</td>', 'Nope. But I can taste the salt on my lips and smell the sea in the air. Has the flavor of old times pictures.', '2011-07-18 05:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473955, 961404, 124815, '<td valign="top">Reminds me distinctly of the paintings of Balthus.</td>', 'Reminds me distinctly of the paintings of Balthus.', '2011-07-18 05:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473956, 961746, 124815, '<td valign="top">Surely not Ben''s but a wonderful shot.</td>', 'Surely not Ben''s but a wonderful shot.', '2011-07-18 05:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473957, 961126, 124815, '<td valign="top">Perhaps too much as expected ....</td>', 'Perhaps too much as expected ....', '2011-07-18 05:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473958, 962123, 124815, '<td valign="top">This shot does not belong in this challenge. It''s very much in the style of the school of neorealism of the Italian cinema of the 60s (La Ciociara) and a great shot indeed.</td>', 'This shot does not belong in this challenge. It''s very much in the style of the school of neorealism of the Italian cinema of the 60s (La Ciociara) and a great shot indeed.', '2011-07-18 05:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473959, 961422, 124815, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Ben"s? No. A good mark from me.</td>', 'Wonderful. Ben"s? No. A good mark from me.', '2011-07-18 05:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474009, 962189, 108311, '<td valign="top">nice pic</td>', 'nice pic', '2011-07-18 08:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474018, 962153, 59737, '<td valign="top">right colors or lack there of but the processing looks forced o me to get the blur</td>', 'right colors or lack there of but the processing looks forced o me to get the blur', '2011-07-18 08:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474019, 962180, 59737, '<td valign="top">great sky, lots of textures and tones on this</td>', 'great sky, lots of textures and tones on this', '2011-07-18 08:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474041, 962307, 61396, '<td valign="top">it''s admirable that the stuff in your head is calm, peaceful and softly lighted. (not voting)</td>', 'it''s admirable that the stuff in your head is calm, peaceful and softly lighted. (not voting)', '2011-07-18 09:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474257, 962098, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is the cleanest, crispest, brightest blur I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'This is the cleanest, crispest, brightest blur I''ve ever seen.', '2011-07-18 12:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474322, 961933, 11769, '<td valign="top">Never played this enough when I was young. Nice lensbaby.</td>', 'Never played this enough when I was young. Nice lensbaby.', '2011-07-18 13:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474323, 961513, 11769, '<td valign="top">The cat is perfect.</td>', 'The cat is perfect.', '2011-07-18 13:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474325, 962005, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nice emotional piece</td>', 'Nice emotional piece', '2011-07-18 13:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474326, 962325, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wonderful emotion. those rocks look painful.</td>', 'Wonderful emotion. those rocks look painful.', '2011-07-18 13:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474328, 962080, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2011-07-18 13:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474329, 961182, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2011-07-18 13:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474330, 962228, 11769, '<td valign="top">Something quiet and beautiful</td>', 'Something quiet and beautiful', '2011-07-18 13:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474331, 962247, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love the energy</td>', 'Love the energy', '2011-07-18 13:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474332, 962297, 11769, '<td valign="top">A lovely door it is.</td>', 'A lovely door it is.', '2011-07-18 13:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474333, 962153, 11769, '<td valign="top">That almost looks like an enormous sun there or a nuke? Haunting.</td>', 'That almost looks like an enormous sun there or a nuke? Haunting.', '2011-07-18 13:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474338, 961856, 11769, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph</td>', 'Very nice photograph', '2011-07-18 13:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474704, 961914, 19825, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. The crop. The blur. Her eye.</td>', 'Very nice shot. The crop. The blur. Her eye.', '2011-07-18 20:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474706, 961162, 19825, '<td valign="top">Great motion.</td>', 'Great motion.', '2011-07-18 20:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474792, 962064, 94815, '<td valign="top">Not Ben but 6 anyway.</td>', 'Not Ben but 6 anyway.', '2011-07-18 22:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474797, 962293, 76335, '<td valign="top">So many forces of nature at work here. Lots to take in here. Nice conversion too.</td>', 'So many forces of nature at work here. Lots to take in here. Nice conversion too.', '2011-07-18 22:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474799, 961944, 76335, '<td valign="top">Technically, it''s just about perfect, and just enough color to help define it without stealing the show. More to the point, a great image of natural forces at work.</td>', 'Technically, it''s just about perfect, and just enough color to help define it without stealing the show. More to the point, a great image of natural forces at work.', '2011-07-18 22:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474804, 961676, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little rougher (more brutal?) than the beachside blur I''m used to seeing of Ben''s. Still, this is interesting on its own terms. The bird looks uncomfortably suspended in the frame. Trapped almost.</td>', 'A little rougher (more brutal?) than the beachside blur I''m used to seeing of Ben''s. Still, this is interesting on its own terms. The bird looks uncomfortably suspended in the frame. Trapped almost.', '2011-07-18 22:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474807, 962305, 76335, '<td valign="top">Water and light collide. Composition needs something more to anchor it, I think, but it''s headed in the right direction.</td>', 'Water and light collide. Composition needs something more to anchor it, I think, but it''s headed in the right direction.', '2011-07-18 22:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474809, 962041, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lots of feet, but the only visible legs (save one) are those made of wood. Interesting.</td>', 'Lots of feet, but the only visible legs (save one) are those made of wood. Interesting.', '2011-07-18 22:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474811, 962299, 76335, '<td valign="top">The warmth and intimacy are clearly inspired by Ben. The background elements are a bit distracting to the child''s profile, but I appreciate the honesty of it all.</td>', 'The warmth and intimacy are clearly inspired by Ben. The background elements are a bit distracting to the child''s profile, but I appreciate the honesty of it all.', '2011-07-18 22:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474813, 961086, 76335, '<td valign="top">Had trouble putting words to this one -- or maybe I was just afraid to. What I''m finding is that this has a certain erotic charge to it. Strangely appealing. I don''t know what else to say.</td>', 'Had trouble putting words to this one -- or maybe I was just afraid to. What I''m finding is that this has a certain erotic charge to it. Strangely appealing. I don''t know what else to say.', '2011-07-18 22:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474824, 962090, 76335, '<td valign="top">A very musical composition -- like following the wand of a great composer.</td>', 'A very musical composition -- like following the wand of a great composer.', '2011-07-18 22:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474828, 962241, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully delicate. a feeling of both floating and flight. Great tones.</td>', 'Beautifully delicate. a feeling of both floating and flight. Great tones.', '2011-07-18 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474895, 962162, 119419, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture</td>', 'Wonderful capture', '2011-07-19 00:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474914, 962307, 60915, '<td valign="top">perhaps from a past life?! : ) Great stuff!! : )</td>', 'perhaps from a past life?! : ) Great stuff!! : )', '2011-07-19 00:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474976, 962247, 54645, '<td valign="top">The columns of light are fascinating.</td>', 'The columns of light are fascinating.', '2011-07-19 01:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474977, 962234, 54645, '<td valign="top">A memorable candid with enjoyable imperfections</td>', 'A memorable candid with enjoyable imperfections', '2011-07-19 01:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474983, 962244, 54645, '<td valign="top">A rather enjoyable scene. I was initially interested in deciphering this fellow and his work...but then I saw that leg and foot. He has no idea what''s coming...</td>', 'A rather enjoyable scene. I was initially interested in deciphering this fellow and his work...but then I saw that leg and foot. He has no idea what''s coming...', '2011-07-19 01:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474984, 962326, 54645, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image. I see a struggle...desperation...the only thing more frightening than falling from a height is falling backwards...</td>', 'Fascinating image. I see a struggle...desperation...the only thing more frightening than falling from a height is falling backwards...', '2011-07-19 01:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474986, 962185, 54645, '<td valign="top">Well rendered, lovely tones and bokeh. I always enjoy nature imaged in this manner. Gives me a sense of place, connected to a mundane plant, flower, etc.</td>', 'Well rendered, lovely tones and bokeh. I always enjoy nature imaged in this manner. Gives me a sense of place, connected to a mundane plant, flower, etc.', '2011-07-19 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474987, 962003, 54645, '<td valign="top">Wow, wild creature.</td>', 'Wow, wild creature.', '2011-07-19 01:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474990, 962002, 54645, '<td valign="top">Waiting patiently for a partner, the giant spots are a playful touch of imperfection reminding me it''s summer.</td>', 'Waiting patiently for a partner, the giant spots are a playful touch of imperfection reminding me it''s summer.', '2011-07-19 01:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474991, 961986, 54645, '<td valign="top">The easy life. Good for him...or is he waiting to escape that tether!</td>', 'The easy life. Good for him...or is he waiting to escape that tether!', '2011-07-19 01:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474993, 962248, 54645, '<td valign="top">...or are you beguiling the creatures of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=86447" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">lydiatoo</a>''s pond?</td>', '...or are you beguiling the creatures of  lydiatoo''s pond?', '2011-07-19 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475002, 961929, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! Her body language is quietly screaming.</td>', 'Ha! Her body language is quietly screaming.', '2011-07-19 02:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475003, 962155, 54645, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of layered subjects, tones, and movement.</td>', 'Excellent use of layered subjects, tones, and movement.', '2011-07-19 02:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475006, 962056, 54645, '<td valign="top">Perfect interpretation and composition. Love the long shadows.</td>', 'Perfect interpretation and composition. Love the long shadows.', '2011-07-19 02:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475007, 961076, 54645, '<td valign="top">This is wild. I like it. Pretty colors and all.</td>', 'This is wild. I like it. Pretty colors and all.', '2011-07-19 02:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475009, 962078, 54645, '<td valign="top">Did you snap that branch on the way down?</td>', 'Did you snap that branch on the way down?', '2011-07-19 02:23:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6475010, 962088, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the overall feel of this image. The off canter bird at the edge of the frame gave me a laugh.  He looks so awkward.</td>', 'I like the overall feel of this image. The off canter bird at the edge of the frame gave me a laugh.  He looks so awkward.', '2011-07-19 02:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475012, 961714, 54645, '<td valign="top">a place to fish as a youth</td>', 'a place to fish as a youth', '2011-07-19 02:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475013, 962323, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Good stuff, lovely textured blur.</td>', 'Ha!  Good stuff, lovely textured blur.', '2011-07-19 02:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475015, 962176, 54645, '<td valign="top">From the perspective of the those he left behind, gasping and dizzy, while he grazes in peace.</td>', 'From the perspective of the those he left behind, gasping and dizzy, while he grazes in peace.', '2011-07-19 02:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475017, 961582, 54645, '<td valign="top">Best way to spend a summer afternoon.</td>', 'Best way to spend a summer afternoon.', '2011-07-19 02:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475018, 962070, 54645, '<td valign="top">...and what did you see?</td>', '...and what did you see?', '2011-07-19 02:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475019, 962256, 54645, '<td valign="top">Lovely candid.</td>', 'Lovely candid.', '2011-07-19 02:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475020, 961746, 54645, '<td valign="top">Now why don''t my water blur shots uncover mermaids?</td>', 'Now why don''t my water blur shots uncover mermaids?', '2011-07-19 02:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475021, 961477, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! Now this is something I don''t recall seeing before. The do look to be floating.</td>', 'Ha! Now this is something I don''t recall seeing before. The do look to be floating.', '2011-07-19 02:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475024, 962063, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! A rather magical composition.</td>', 'Ha! A rather magical composition.', '2011-07-19 02:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475025, 961517, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nothing to see...except those jeans look good.</td>', 'Nothing to see...except those jeans look good.', '2011-07-19 02:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475027, 962091, 54645, '<td valign="top">Lensbaby bokeh. Wonderful shapes.</td>', 'Lensbaby bokeh. Wonderful shapes.', '2011-07-19 02:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475030, 961971, 54645, '<td valign="top">Laid out, dizzy with exhaustion, desperately thirsty! Ha! A fun image</td>', 'Laid out, dizzy with exhaustion, desperately thirsty! Ha! A fun image', '2011-07-19 02:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475032, 961763, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! That''s a good hair day.</td>', 'Ha! That''s a good hair day.', '2011-07-19 02:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475033, 962103, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the choice to go with this frame. The distant piece of infocus area gives me context to her training. Where she is going...maybe just heading out, but possibly finished given the light and contrast. The layered sidewalks blurring in to the distance...the way a run should go...</td>', 'I like the choice to go with this frame. The distant piece of infocus area gives me context to her training. Where she is going...maybe just heading out, but possibly finished given the light and contrast. The layered sidewalks blurring in to the distance...the way a run should go...', '2011-07-19 02:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475036, 962325, 54645, '<td valign="top">She has some sturdy, well shoed, feet! A playful image.</td>', 'She has some sturdy, well shoed, feet! A playful image.', '2011-07-19 02:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475037, 962180, 54645, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky. Makes me small, but full of wonder.</td>', 'Dramatic sky. Makes me small, but full of wonder.', '2011-07-19 02:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475039, 962015, 54645, '<td valign="top">nope, it does not</td>', 'nope, it does not', '2011-07-19 02:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475042, 962036, 54645, '<td valign="top">She is finally free.</td>', 'She is finally free.', '2011-07-19 02:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475076, 962113, 100393, '<td valign="top">As Bennish as you might see; wouldn''t be at all surprised if it is. A 10 for the image though, not just the emulation.</td>', 'As Bennish as you might see; wouldn''t be at all surprised if it is. A 10 for the image though, not just the emulation.', '2011-07-19 03:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475082, 962065, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very Bennish. The combination of authenticity and lovely imagery/execution gets you a 10 from me.</td>', 'Very Bennish. The combination of authenticity and lovely imagery/execution gets you a 10 from me.', '2011-07-19 03:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475083, 961788, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very well done, very Bennish too - bumping to a 10.</td>', 'Very well done, very Bennish too - bumping to a 10.', '2011-07-19 03:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475085, 961447, 100393, '<td valign="top">Flat out magnificent picture; would get a 10 in a Free Study from me. Only fair to bump you up from 9 to 10 here,</td>', 'Flat out magnificent picture; would get a 10 in a Free Study from me. Only fair to bump you up from 9 to 10 here,', '2011-07-19 04:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475086, 962325, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very nearly there, the tones don''t seem quite right for this to be full emulation. A lovely image just the same though, earning a 9 from me.</td>', 'Very nearly there, the tones don''t seem quite right for this to be full emulation. A lovely image just the same though, earning a 9 from me.', '2011-07-19 04:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475087, 961450, 100393, '<td valign="top">Makes me think <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">clive_patric_nolan</a>, couldn''t say why. I like it a lot. Not fantastically Bennish but there are accents. Great as a standalone image. Gets a 9 from me.</td>', 'Makes me think  clive_patric_nolan, couldn''t say why. I like it a lot. Not fantastically Bennish but there are accents. Great as a standalone image. Gets a 9 from me.', '2011-07-19 04:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475091, 962259, 100393, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is Ben but it is a wonderful image. 10 given and well deserved. If I had to guess, I''d have this pegged as a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nixter</a>.</td>', 'I don''t think this is Ben but it is a wonderful image. 10 given and well deserved. If I had to guess, I''d have this pegged as a  nixter.', '2011-07-19 04:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475092, 962098, 100393, '<td valign="top">A 10 for the quality of the image - perhaps <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=22301" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jdannels</a>. Marvellous stuff.</td>', 'A 10 for the quality of the image - perhaps  jdannels. Marvellous stuff.', '2011-07-19 04:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475094, 962319, 100393, '<td valign="top">Flat out beautiful image. Excellent choice going colour - got a 10 from me. Make me think of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a> but I couldn''t say why.</td>', 'Flat out beautiful image. Excellent choice going colour - got a 10 from me. Make me think of  Bear_Music but I couldn''t say why.', '2011-07-19 04:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
