(6475162, 962094, 76335, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this summons Ben. I like that you''ve eschewed poetic titling and let this stand (or fall) on its own. Interesting bokeh.</td>', 'The simplicity of this summons Ben. I like that you''ve eschewed poetic titling and let this stand (or fall) on its own. Interesting bokeh.', '2011-07-19 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475171, 962153, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the processing (selective blur?) but the composition is interesting -- the hat, the stride, that she''s about to be crushed by background structure...</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the processing (selective blur?) but the composition is interesting -- the hat, the stride, that she''s about to be crushed by background structure...', '2011-07-19 08:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475175, 962103, 76335, '<td valign="top">As a rule, I''m not crazy about backsides or telephoto candids. Yet I have to admit to being mildly intrigued by this. It has a voyeuristic quality. Who or what is lurking in those nicely manicured suburban bushes, I wonder.</td>', 'As a rule, I''m not crazy about backsides or telephoto candids. Yet I have to admit to being mildly intrigued by this. It has a voyeuristic quality. Who or what is lurking in those nicely manicured suburban bushes, I wonder.', '2011-07-19 08:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475176, 962248, 104230, '<td valign="top">Interesting light to dark gradient.</td>', 'Interesting light to dark gradient.', '2011-07-19 08:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475183, 961833, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is more clinical than anything I''ve seen of Ben''s. The grain feels less like a mood enhancer and more like a byproduct of an extreme macro or low-light capture. These are observations, reactions -- not really criticisms. I like what you''re showing us, and the monochrome emphasizes the structure and texture of the plant like it should.</td>', 'This is more clinical than anything I''ve seen of Ben''s. The grain feels less like a mood enhancer and more like a byproduct of an extreme macro or low-light capture. These are observations, reactions -- not really criticisms. I like what you''re showing us, and the monochrome emphasizes the structure and texture of the plant like it should.', '2011-07-19 08:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475186, 961915, 76335, '<td valign="top">There''s an interesting dichotomy here. On one hand, it''s a beautifully complex modern structure, framed to show that off to maximum effect. On the other, the monochrome shows us how weathered it is. If it weren''t for the stunning architecture, we might guess that these were the walls of an industrial or abandoned structure.</td>', 'There''s an interesting dichotomy here. On one hand, it''s a beautifully complex modern structure, framed to show that off to maximum effect. On the other, the monochrome shows us how weathered it is. If it weren''t for the stunning architecture, we might guess that these were the walls of an industrial or abandoned structure.', '2011-07-19 08:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
