(6475346, 962036, 100831, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble putting into words how much I''m enjoying this image... over and over. I don''t know what Ben will say but I imagine something like I wish I had taken this. Well maybe not since he''s a neurologist and has three little kids at home but anyway.... it''s just too funny. And I KNOW that many more of us look just like this at 8:31 than care to admit.</td>', 'I''m having trouble putting into words how much I''m enjoying this image... over and over. I don''t know what Ben will say but I imagine something like I wish I had taken this. Well maybe not since he''s a neurologist and has three little kids at home but anyway.... it''s just too funny. And I KNOW that many more of us look just like this at 8:31 than care to admit.', '2011-07-19 13:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
