(6476018, 962101, 68504, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of the lowering sky/clouds, the time blur, the perspective.  Not sure the light streak adds to this rich unsettling darkness.  (Probably better not to title with the feeling that we are likely to feel - better to let us come to it on our own through the power of your photo).</td>', 'I like the sense of the lowering sky/clouds, the time blur, the perspective.  Not sure the light streak adds to this rich unsettling darkness.  (Probably better not to title with the feeling that we are likely to feel - better to let us come to it on our own through the power of your photo).', '2011-07-20 00:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
