(6476385, 962198, 60915, '<td valign="top">I love the elements in this image. It makes me uncomfortable. The hand touching the woman''s leg, I wonder if she approves? and the man''s leg, standing there by itself, appears unnatural and artificial, removed from it''s body. Wonderful stuff!! I hope people take the time to look longer : )</td>', 'I love the elements in this image. It makes me uncomfortable. The hand touching the woman''s leg, I wonder if she approves? and the man''s leg, standing there by itself, appears unnatural and artificial, removed from it''s body. Wonderful stuff!! I hope people take the time to look longer : )', '2011-07-20 05:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
