(6476494, 961885, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like an old mission building or some such. Lots of history here. A good imposing view point. There''s something telling about the time on the clock. Is it stuck there, or is it a working clock? Could be midday sun, judging by the shadows. The bird adds some needed poetry, as does the double-edged title.</td>', 'Looks like an old mission building or some such. Lots of history here. A good imposing view point. There''s something telling about the time on the clock. Is it stuck there, or is it a working clock? Could be midday sun, judging by the shadows. The bird adds some needed poetry, as does the double-edged title.', '2011-07-20 08:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476499, 961986, 76335, '<td valign="top">Have to admit, at first glance of the thumb, I thought it was a pig or some such. I don''t think Ben has a pig. I have neither a pig nor a dog. Anyway, cute, and nicely done in black and white.</td>', 'Have to admit, at first glance of the thumb, I thought it was a pig or some such. I don''t think Ben has a pig. I have neither a pig nor a dog. Anyway, cute, and nicely done in black and white.', '2011-07-20 08:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
