(6476783, 962113, 96751, '<td valign="top">Why is that guy sweeping the shore...???<br/> <br/>Gorgeous.  Love the elongated reflections and the ghostly sunlight</td>', 'Why is that guy sweeping the shore...??? Gorgeous.  Love the elongated reflections and the ghostly sunlight', '2011-07-20 12:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476784, 962145, 96751, '<td valign="top">This would make a great "missed" focus entry.</td>', 'This would make a great "missed" focus entry.', '2011-07-20 12:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476785, 961724, 96751, '<td valign="top">Brian?  A boldness that eludes definition.</td>', 'Brian?  A boldness that eludes definition.', '2011-07-20 12:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476786, 961162, 96751, '<td valign="top">Like he''s racing against the current.  Wonderful sense of motion.</td>', 'Like he''s racing against the current.  Wonderful sense of motion.', '2011-07-20 12:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476787, 962104, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a fun image!!  Very creative and perfectly executed.</td>', 'What a fun image!!  Very creative and perfectly executed.', '2011-07-20 12:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476788, 961676, 96751, '<td valign="top">This almost has a 3-d quality!</td>', 'This almost has a 3-d quality!', '2011-07-20 12:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476789, 961119, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  Although the bokeh is a bit overpowering.</td>', 'Gorgeous!  Although the bokeh is a bit overpowering.', '2011-07-20 12:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476790, 961130, 96751, '<td valign="top">A very intriguing image, and an interesting interpretation of Ben''s style.  I love the movement, although I miss the delicacy of his pp''ing.</td>', 'A very intriguing image, and an interesting interpretation of Ben''s style.  I love the movement, although I miss the delicacy of his pp''ing.', '2011-07-20 12:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476793, 962117, 96751, '<td valign="top">Splendid.  I''d argue that the tones need to be just a tish richer, but this is pretty darn close to his water studies!</td>', 'Splendid.  I''d argue that the tones need to be just a tish richer, but this is pretty darn close to his water studies!', '2011-07-20 12:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476795, 962330, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ben does Blair Witch Project...?  Gritty and deliciously textural.</td>', 'Ben does Blair Witch Project...?  Gritty and deliciously textural.', '2011-07-20 12:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476796, 961165, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.  But for me there is too much of a disconnect between the flower head and the rest of the image.</td>', 'Very lovely.  But for me there is too much of a disconnect between the flower head and the rest of the image.', '2011-07-20 12:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476797, 962240, 96751, '<td valign="top">Like fractured thought</td>', 'Like fractured thought', '2011-07-20 12:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476798, 962307, 96751, '<td valign="top">Remarkable image.</td>', 'Remarkable image.', '2011-07-20 12:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476799, 962323, 96751, '<td valign="top">The inner glow of this image is VERY Bennish to me.  Absolutely love the squiggly blur of the hedges.</td>', 'The inner glow of this image is VERY Bennish to me.  Absolutely love the squiggly blur of the hedges.', '2011-07-20 12:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476800, 962180, 96751, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d totally desated this image, because the two touches of yellow, in the middle of the clouds and at the horizon, are incredibly distracting.  That said, amazing sky.</td>', 'I wish you''d totally desated this image, because the two touches of yellow, in the middle of the clouds and at the horizon, are incredibly distracting.  That said, amazing sky.', '2011-07-20 12:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476803, 962241, 96751, '<td valign="top">Exquisite.  Like the lure of a galactic fisherman.</td>', 'Exquisite.  Like the lure of a galactic fisherman.', '2011-07-20 12:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476805, 962036, 96751, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2011-07-20 12:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476806, 962033, 96751, '<td valign="top">The topic and lb choice are Ben, but the selective desat are not.  Wonderful image, regardless.</td>', 'The topic and lb choice are Ben, but the selective desat are not.  Wonderful image, regardless.', '2011-07-20 12:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476807, 961833, 96751, '<td valign="top">Unfriendly.  Great macro!</td>', 'Unfriendly.  Great macro!', '2011-07-20 12:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476809, 962097, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful street scene!</td>', 'Wonderful street scene!', '2011-07-20 12:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476814, 962215, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!  Fantastic title for this image.  The image ain''t bad either</td>', 'LOL!!!  Fantastic title for this image.  The image ain''t bad either', '2011-07-20 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476815, 962259, 96751, '<td valign="top">As though viewed through frosted glass that was slowly unfogging.</td>', 'As though viewed through frosted glass that was slowly unfogging.', '2011-07-20 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476817, 961198, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t know... does Ben watch sports..???</td>', 'I don''t know... does Ben watch sports..???', '2011-07-20 12:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476818, 961746, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fotoman does Spurgeon???  Such a crisp image.</td>', 'Fotoman does Spurgeon???  Such a crisp image.', '2011-07-20 12:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476819, 962325, 96751, '<td valign="top">Jenn, superbly Spurgeonesque.</td>', 'Jenn, superbly Spurgeonesque.', '2011-07-20 12:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476821, 961447, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ah, pier fishing.  Great catch :-)</td>', 'Ah, pier fishing.  Great catch :-)', '2011-07-20 12:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476822, 961357, 96751, '<td valign="top">The title is a moving story, but I find it terribly heavy-handed for such a delicate and beautifully-edited image.</td>', 'The title is a moving story, but I find it terribly heavy-handed for such a delicate and beautifully-edited image.', '2011-07-20 12:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476823, 962088, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yes, this has that Ben luminescence.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Yes, this has that Ben luminescence.  Beautiful.', '2011-07-20 12:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476824, 961730, 96751, '<td valign="top">An adorable portrait</td>', 'An adorable portrait', '2011-07-20 12:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476825, 962026, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it''s possible to take a back picture of zebras.  Beautiful, dramatic portrait, although not particularly Bennish to me.</td>', 'I don''t think it''s possible to take a back picture of zebras.  Beautiful, dramatic portrait, although not particularly Bennish to me.', '2011-07-20 12:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476826, 961915, 96751, '<td valign="top">Imposing structure.  Perhaps a little too "literal" for a Ben image.</td>', 'Imposing structure.  Perhaps a little too "literal" for a Ben image.', '2011-07-20 12:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476827, 961757, 96751, '<td valign="top">Divine image.  Those rocks are breathtaking.  Doesn''t hurt to have a killer sunset as well.  As for it being Bennish... to me, not so much.</td>', 'Divine image.  Those rocks are breathtaking.  Doesn''t hurt to have a killer sunset as well.  As for it being Bennish... to me, not so much.', '2011-07-20 12:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476828, 962152, 96751, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2011-07-20 12:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476829, 961742, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Looks like it''s leapfrogging or something.</td>', 'Awesome.  Looks like it''s leapfrogging or something.', '2011-07-20 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476830, 962319, 96751, '<td valign="top">How''s this doing, Penny.  I''m viewing it now in the context of the other images, and it''s a real standout.</td>', 'How''s this doing, Penny.  I''m viewing it now in the context of the other images, and it''s a real standout.', '2011-07-20 12:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476833, 962140, 96751, '<td valign="top">Classic, unknown journey image.  Love it.  Love the grain.  Love the exquisite balance.</td>', 'Classic, unknown journey image.  Love it.  Love the grain.  Love the exquisite balance.', '2011-07-20 12:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476834, 962037, 96751, '<td valign="top">These feeding frenzies can be really intimidating.  Love the abstraction.</td>', 'These feeding frenzies can be really intimidating.  Love the abstraction.', '2011-07-20 12:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476835, 962326, 96751, '<td valign="top">Deeply disturbing.  Like a wreck from which you cannot look away.</td>', 'Deeply disturbing.  Like a wreck from which you cannot look away.', '2011-07-20 12:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476836, 962147, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space, dramatic image, though the subject and style do not remind me of Ben''s work.</td>', 'Great use of negative space, dramatic image, though the subject and style do not remind me of Ben''s work.', '2011-07-20 12:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476837, 962238, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous portrait</td>', 'Gorgeous portrait', '2011-07-20 12:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476838, 961453, 96751, '<td valign="top">I loved discovering the man!</td>', 'I loved discovering the man!', '2011-07-20 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476839, 962298, 96751, '<td valign="top">Delightfully framed.</td>', 'Delightfully framed.', '2011-07-20 12:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476840, 962258, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ben style macro.  LOL!</td>', 'Ben style macro.  LOL!', '2011-07-20 12:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476841, 962091, 96751, '<td valign="top">Most decidedly "in the style of", although I am suddenly aware that he has no round bokeh, just linear.</td>', 'Most decidedly "in the style of", although I am suddenly aware that he has no round bokeh, just linear.', '2011-07-20 12:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476842, 962328, 96751, '<td valign="top">The tilt, the LB, I''m getting seasick...</td>', 'The tilt, the LB, I''m getting seasick...', '2011-07-20 12:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476843, 961587, 96751, '<td valign="top">Intriguing!!  Awesome abstract</td>', 'Intriguing!!  Awesome abstract', '2011-07-20 12:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476845, 961999, 96751, '<td valign="top">I LOVE old car parades.  Love that the guy in the front car is wearing a fedora.</td>', 'I LOVE old car parades.  Love that the guy in the front car is wearing a fedora.', '2011-07-20 12:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476846, 961788, 96751, '<td valign="top">Delicious.  Don''t know about the spinning movement, but it''s very interesting.  That, and her tail.</td>', 'Delicious.  Don''t know about the spinning movement, but it''s very interesting.  That, and her tail.', '2011-07-20 12:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476847, 962000, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  This is SO cool.  I don''t find it remotely like Ben''s work, but since he''s constantly reinventing himself...  Stunning image.</td>', 'Oh wow.  This is SO cool.  I don''t find it remotely like Ben''s work, but since he''s constantly reinventing himself...  Stunning image.', '2011-07-20 12:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476848, 962218, 96751, '<td valign="top">A loyal reproduction.</td>', 'A loyal reproduction.', '2011-07-20 12:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476849, 961933, 96751, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  The mallet seems to be moving towards me!</td>', 'Whoa!  The mallet seems to be moving towards me!', '2011-07-20 12:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476850, 961422, 96751, '<td valign="top">Homage to celluloid film...?  Incredible sculpture. Gorgeous pov.</td>', 'Homage to celluloid film...?  Incredible sculpture. Gorgeous pov.', '2011-07-20 12:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476851, 962155, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love it and the infinite number of literal and figurative layers.</td>', 'Love it and the infinite number of literal and figurative layers.', '2011-07-20 12:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476854, 961182, 96751, '<td valign="top">KILLER motion blur.  Very reminiscent of his movement.</td>', 'KILLER motion blur.  Very reminiscent of his movement.', '2011-07-20 12:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476859, 961835, 96751, '<td valign="top">Clearly a local DPCer, or a visiting DPCer who will be on every local DPCer''s s**t list for not saying hi while in town :-)<br/> <br/>Been here a million times - NEVER noticed the Disney lettering on the right of the stairs.</td>', 'Clearly a local DPCer, or a visiting DPCer who will be on every local DPCer''s s**t list for not saying hi while in town :-) Been here a million times - NEVER noticed the Disney lettering on the right of the stairs.', '2011-07-20 13:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476860, 962041, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful framing!</td>', 'Wonderful framing!', '2011-07-20 13:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476861, 962297, 96751, '<td valign="top">A marvelous image, but I''m learning that I don''t enjoy looking at lensbaby AND motion blur, together.</td>', 'A marvelous image, but I''m learning that I don''t enjoy looking at lensbaby AND motion blur, together.', '2011-07-20 13:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476862, 962299, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and child</td>', 'Beautiful light and child', '2011-07-20 13:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476863, 962175, 96751, '<td valign="top">I could definitely see this as a Ben image, although the shell seems a bit over lightened, to the point where it does not seem to be native to the scene.</td>', 'I could definitely see this as a Ben image, although the shell seems a bit over lightened, to the point where it does not seem to be native to the scene.', '2011-07-20 13:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476864, 961126, 96751, '<td valign="top">I find this to be more of a bvy image than a spurgeon image.  Either way, it invites contemplation and study.</td>', 'I find this to be more of a bvy image than a spurgeon image.  Either way, it invites contemplation and study.', '2011-07-20 13:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476865, 962292, 96751, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal.  Love the "cartoon" spinning circles of the legs.  A sense of joy, fun, urgency, all rolled into one.</td>', 'Phenomenal.  Love the "cartoon" spinning circles of the legs.  A sense of joy, fun, urgency, all rolled into one.', '2011-07-20 13:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476866, 962244, 96751, '<td valign="top">Terrific image.  The subject is strong enough to dissipate the clutter behind him, although I''d have preferred less clutter.  Gorgeous pp''ing.</td>', 'Terrific image.  The subject is strong enough to dissipate the clutter behind him, although I''d have preferred less clutter.  Gorgeous pp''ing.', '2011-07-20 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476867, 962005, 96751, '<td valign="top">Imbued with Bennish nostalgia</td>', 'Imbued with Bennish nostalgia', '2011-07-20 13:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476869, 962153, 96751, '<td valign="top">You won''t get it.  Your image is too good.</td>', 'You won''t get it.  Your image is too good.', '2011-07-20 13:08:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6476872, 962098, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love how his upper body has totally disappeared.  A remarkable image, which however, does not look Bennish to me.</td>', 'Love how his upper body has totally disappeared.  A remarkable image, which however, does not look Bennish to me.', '2011-07-20 13:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476873, 962234, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, although her expression is a bit offputting.</td>', 'Beautiful image, although her expression is a bit offputting.', '2011-07-20 13:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476874, 962324, 96751, '<td valign="top">Like they''re wrestling a captured sunbeam.</td>', 'Like they''re wrestling a captured sunbeam.', '2011-07-20 13:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476875, 962198, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredibly odd and delightful.</td>', 'Incredibly odd and delightful.', '2011-07-20 13:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476876, 962063, 96751, '<td valign="top">Herring...?  The metallic tones are divine.</td>', 'Herring...?  The metallic tones are divine.', '2011-07-20 13:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476877, 962020, 96751, '<td valign="top">Then a giant vacuum hose appeared and sucked him up.</td>', 'Then a giant vacuum hose appeared and sucked him up.', '2011-07-20 13:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476878, 962062, 96751, '<td valign="top">One of those ginormous bird moths?  Incredible.</td>', 'One of those ginormous bird moths?  Incredible.', '2011-07-20 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476879, 962321, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice, but there is a loss of detail, an ironing out that I don''t find appealing.</td>', 'Nice, but there is a loss of detail, an ironing out that I don''t find appealing.', '2011-07-20 13:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476881, 961191, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous image.  Very powerful and rich.  Can''t say it''s particularly Bennish, but it is excellent.  Killer light, and just enough texture and detail in the negative space to make me be afraid.  Be very afraid.</td>', 'Marvelous image.  Very powerful and rich.  Can''t say it''s particularly Bennish, but it is excellent.  Killer light, and just enough texture and detail in the negative space to make me be afraid.  Be very afraid.', '2011-07-20 13:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476882, 962232, 96751, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite flowers.  Looks like it''s falling away from us, in the void of outer space.</td>', 'One of my favorite flowers.  Looks like it''s falling away from us, in the void of outer space.', '2011-07-20 13:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476883, 962227, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful dof.  Looks like the top of the head of some large stick bug.</td>', 'Wonderful dof.  Looks like the top of the head of some large stick bug.', '2011-07-20 13:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476884, 962294, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light</td>', 'Gorgeous light', '2011-07-20 13:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476886, 962217, 96751, '<td valign="top">What an image!!  A most excellent placement of the pot in the diamond of light.  Overwhelming grittiness - as if a pleasant memory was shrouded with misery.</td>', 'What an image!!  A most excellent placement of the pot in the diamond of light.  Overwhelming grittiness - as if a pleasant memory was shrouded with misery.', '2011-07-20 13:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476887, 961450, 96751, '<td valign="top">These zoom captures make me so queasy.  But this certainly shows that "inner light" I love so much in Ben''s work.</td>', 'These zoom captures make me so queasy.  But this certainly shows that "inner light" I love so much in Ben''s work.', '2011-07-20 13:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476888, 961779, 96751, '<td valign="top">Based solely on location, I''d say this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75618" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">odriew</a>''s entry.  Regardless, it has a splendid Bennish quality.  My favorite part is the light on the rippled sand.</td>', 'Based solely on location, I''d say this is  odriew''s entry.  Regardless, it has a splendid Bennish quality.  My favorite part is the light on the rippled sand.', '2011-07-20 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476889, 962003, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve ever seen a ladybug like this.  Fantastic macro.  Love the desat to ALMOST duotone.  Killer.</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve ever seen a ladybug like this.  Fantastic macro.  Love the desat to ALMOST duotone.  Killer.', '2011-07-20 13:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476890, 961811, 96751, '<td valign="top">This style isn''t quite as Bennish as it is one of the other blur artisans, not quite sure who.  But it is a very notable homage.  Flares are so underrated.  But what''s with the dust bunny....?</td>', 'This style isn''t quite as Bennish as it is one of the other blur artisans, not quite sure who.  But it is a very notable homage.  Flares are so underrated.  But what''s with the dust bunny....?', '2011-07-20 13:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476891, 962089, 96751, '<td valign="top">Reminds me so much of an image I did a while ago.  Beautiful lines in the blur.</td>', 'Reminds me so much of an image I did a while ago.  Beautiful lines in the blur.', '2011-07-20 13:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476892, 962169, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is VERY reminiscent of Ben''s latest work.  Adore kitties, and this is a wonderful homage to felines everywhere.</td>', 'This is VERY reminiscent of Ben''s latest work.  Adore kitties, and this is a wonderful homage to felines everywhere.', '2011-07-20 13:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476893, 961159, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures</td>', 'Beautiful textures', '2011-07-20 13:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476894, 961582, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fun!!!  I like the image in its own right, but find it looks sharpened, a technique I have not noticed Ben use with any frequency.</td>', 'Fun!!!  I like the image in its own right, but find it looks sharpened, a technique I have not noticed Ben use with any frequency.', '2011-07-20 13:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476895, 962073, 96751, '<td valign="top">Certainly the right topic, and in the right tonal ranges.  For me, it''s the composition that appears to be just slightly non-Bennish.</td>', 'Certainly the right topic, and in the right tonal ranges.  For me, it''s the composition that appears to be just slightly non-Bennish.', '2011-07-20 13:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476896, 962214, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fowl as punctuation.  Love it.</td>', 'Fowl as punctuation.  Love it.', '2011-07-20 13:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476897, 961917, 96751, '<td valign="top">A wild child.  Too straight on and posed for a Ben shot, but killer portrait.</td>', 'A wild child.  Too straight on and posed for a Ben shot, but killer portrait.', '2011-07-20 13:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476898, 962094, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yes, but a bit cliche</td>', 'Yes, but a bit cliche', '2011-07-20 13:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476899, 961513, 96751, '<td valign="top">I am probably totally wrong, but this has more of a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=100393" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">paulbtlw</a> feel to it than Ben''s.  Love that feeling of having caught something of note, though we don''t yet know what - an image that will play a crucial role in the unraveling of a twisted plot.  Not that that''s important, because it''s going straight to faves.</td>', 'I am probably totally wrong, but this has more of a  paulbtlw feel to it than Ben''s.  Love that feeling of having caught something of note, though we don''t yet know what - an image that will play a crucial role in the unraveling of a twisted plot.  Not that that''s important, because it''s going straight to faves.', '2011-07-20 13:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476900, 961831, 96751, '<td valign="top">Certainly the inner glow</td>', 'Certainly the inner glow', '2011-07-20 13:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476902, 962035, 96751, '<td valign="top">Every time I look at this I get hungry, Bear.</td>', 'Every time I look at this I get hungry, Bear.', '2011-07-20 13:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476903, 962080, 96751, '<td valign="top">Indeed.  And a Rastafarian dog to boot.</td>', 'Indeed.  And a Rastafarian dog to boot.', '2011-07-20 13:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
