(6477590, 962175, 61396, '<td valign="top">I am not voting, so you can just ignore my comment. I think this is a great photo (toning is marvelous) and a complete miss of the bspurgeon style, as it doesn''t leave a lot of room to the viewer own interpretation. This continues with the title, which tries to dictate even the order of looking at things.<br/> <br/>Coming back after I noticed Ben''s "wave..shell......gull"<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=954295" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1399/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_954295.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1399/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_954295.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1399/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_954295.jpg"/></a> <br/>I''m still leaving the comment above with the caveat that it (the comment) only reflects my own subjective interpretation of Ben''s style, and to show how pigheaded I can be. Hope you can forgive me.</td>', 'I am not voting, so you can just ignore my comment. I think this is a great photo (toning is marvelous) and a complete miss of the bspurgeon style, as it doesn''t leave a lot of room to the viewer own interpretation. This continues with the title, which tries to dictate even the order of looking at things. Coming back after I noticed Ben''s "wave..shell......gull" I''m still leaving the comment above with the caveat that it (the comment) only reflects my own subjective interpretation of Ben''s style, and to show how pigheaded I can be. Hope you can forgive me.', '2011-07-21 09:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
