(6477725, 962005, 75713, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo.  However, I really like this shot and the possibilities it has for so many stories . Why is she walking through a field in such a delicate dress .. is she taking a short cut to meet someone?  I love the sepia, the delicate edge of the dress, the foreground bokeh - beautifully done.</td>', 'I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo.  However, I really like this shot and the possibilities it has for so many stories . Why is she walking through a field in such a delicate dress .. is she taking a short cut to meet someone?  I love the sepia, the delicate edge of the dress, the foreground bokeh - beautifully done.', '2011-07-21 14:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
