(6477728, 962108, 75713, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo. I really enjoy this shot ... I especially like how the bottom half is a checkered blur - the tilt of the man''s head, the expression on his face makes me wonder what he is looking - the b/g curtains kind of match the f/g blur - the veins in his neck add to the intensity of the photo  - I feel like he is completely unaware you are taking his photo - very well seen and photographed.</td>', 'I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo. I really enjoy this shot ... I especially like how the bottom half is a checkered blur - the tilt of the man''s head, the expression on his face makes me wonder what he is looking - the b/g curtains kind of match the f/g blur - the veins in his neck add to the intensity of the photo  - I feel like he is completely unaware you are taking his photo - very well seen and photographed.', '2011-07-21 14:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6477730, 962073, 75713, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo. Whimsical and delicate - beautiful b/g - I love how you pped this shot - you really brought it to it''s best - beautifully done.</td>', 'I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo. Whimsical and delicate - beautiful b/g - I love how you pped this shot - you really brought it to it''s best - beautifully done.', '2011-07-21 14:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6477733, 961724, 75713, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo. An interesting abstract with a very good title as it adds a layer of meaning - I like the soft blur and the tonal qualities.</td>', 'I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo. An interesting abstract with a very good title as it adds a layer of meaning - I like the soft blur and the tonal qualities.', '2011-07-21 14:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6477738, 962323, 75713, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo. There is so much motion in this photo and I love the varied ways you made that happen .. the running couple, the dancing waves of motion blur/lines - the head gear on the front runner looks like some kind of stuffed animal, maybe a sheep - adding a touch of whimsy .. the slight tilt in the road makes it look like they are really getting a workout - Interesting shadows, wonderful pping .. this is a very well done shot.</td>', 'I don''t know enough about Ben''s style to comment on that aspect of your photo. There is so much motion in this photo and I love the varied ways you made that happen .. the running couple, the dancing waves of motion blur/lines - the head gear on the front runner looks like some kind of stuffed animal, maybe a sheep - adding a touch of whimsy .. the slight tilt in the road makes it look like they are really getting a workout - Interesting shadows, wonderful pping .. this is a very well done shot.', '2011-07-21 14:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6477742, 962063, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like this and keep coming back to it, so it does draw me in in some way. But I also keep finding that I like it more in the thumbnail than the full image where it seems too contrived, in the sense of being set up and with all the blur/distortion created by obvious camera movement rather than being an image that captures a moment or movement spontaneously, which IMO is a Ben hallmark.</td>', 'I like this and keep coming back to it, so it does draw me in in some way. But I also keep finding that I like it more in the thumbnail than the full image where it seems too contrived, in the sense of being set up and with all the blur/distortion created by obvious camera movement rather than being an image that captures a moment or movement spontaneously, which IMO is a Ben hallmark.', '2011-07-21 14:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
