(6478223, 961130, 75713, '<td valign="top">I am not competent enough to comment or compare entries to Ben''s style so I am not going to try. <br/>Amazing sense of movement and intense emotion that allows me to make up a story that suits my idea of what this photo is about .. funny, what comes to mind is a pilot in a war .. maybe WWII - about to eject ... or praying for a miracle to help land a damaged plane .. fantastic tonal qualities..this shot should so very well and it is my hope it does. I will certainly do my best to ensure a high score for you.</td>', 'I am not competent enough to comment or compare entries to Ben''s style so I am not going to try. Amazing sense of movement and intense emotion that allows me to make up a story that suits my idea of what this photo is about .. funny, what comes to mind is a pilot in a war .. maybe WWII - about to eject ... or praying for a miracle to help land a damaged plane .. fantastic tonal qualities..this shot should so very well and it is my hope it does. I will certainly do my best to ensure a high score for you.', '2011-07-22 00:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
