(6478457, 961788, 75713, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shot - I wish I had gotten around to commenting on all the photos because this one is fascinating .. she does, as others have commented, look like she has a tail --- what a story that could be conjured up in an active imagination regarding this shot .. it''s excellent and I would have given it at least an 8.</td>', 'What a wonderful shot - I wish I had gotten around to commenting on all the photos because this one is fascinating .. she does, as others have commented, look like she has a tail --- what a story that could be conjured up in an active imagination regarding this shot .. it''s excellent and I would have given it at least an 8.', '2011-07-22 01:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
