(6478800, 961404, 65319, '<td valign="top">Johanna, this image is one that initially did not capture me, but the more I stared at it...the more enchanted I became with the quiescent lighting and immortal pose especially in her sleeping almost marbled face.  I loved the way you processed this image as well.  Nicely polished.  8</td>', 'Johanna, this image is one that initially did not capture me, but the more I stared at it...the more enchanted I became with the quiescent lighting and immortal pose especially in her sleeping almost marbled face.  I loved the way you processed this image as well.  Nicely polished.  8', '2011-07-22 12:45:39.000000', NULL, 0);
