(6478844, 961914, 75713, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to commenting on as many shots as I would have liked to - I gave this a 7 - what a wonderful bunch of other shots too, esp the little girl with the camera, you caught her expression just perfectly as any of us who have had children can attest to with the slightly puzzled look filled with determination.  What a day that must have been.  Thanks so much for the gallery of the man who is Ben.</td>', 'I didn''t get to commenting on as many shots as I would have liked to - I gave this a 7 - what a wonderful bunch of other shots too, esp the little girl with the camera, you caught her expression just perfectly as any of us who have had children can attest to with the slightly puzzled look filled with determination.  What a day that must have been.  Thanks so much for the gallery of the man who is Ben.', '2011-07-22 13:28:49.000000', NULL, 0),
