(6509104, 962063, 54645, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bspurgeon:</b></div><hr/><i> Ha! A rather magical composition. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You asked for feedback and negative comments to help reconcile your score with the positive comments. Magical to me, but likely static and dull to the average viewer. This is another exercise in the arrangement of a still life. I really like this image, a nice strong funk. I suppose a square crop, or 4x5, to bring in the symmetry you sought in your arrangement. Gave it a 6. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-19 03:25:03.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by bspurgeon: Ha! A rather magical composition.   You asked for feedback and negative comments to help reconcile your score with the positive comments. Magical to me, but likely static and dull to the average viewer. This is another exercise in the arrangement of a still life. I really like this image, a nice strong funk. I suppose a square crop, or 4x5, to bring in the symmetry you sought in your arrangement. Gave it a 6. ', '2011-08-19 04:24:34.000000', '2011-08-19 04:25:03.000000', 0),
